00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't get up yet.</font></font>

492
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't get up. Stay there.</font></font>

493
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'll make it worse.</font></font>

494
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did it hurt when you fell?</font></font>

495
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It hurt then, but it doesn't now.</font></font>

496
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's normal right now.</font></font>

497
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The swelling hasn't settled yet.</font></font>

498
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It'll take three or four hours.</font></font>

499
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does it feel like it's locking up?</font></font>

500
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Try extending your leg a little.</font></font>

501
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Straighten it. Does it catch at all?</font></font>

502
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay. No.</font></font>

503
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get some rest.</font></font>

504
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've had this injury before.</font></font>

505
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't tell how bad it is yet.</font></font>

506
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be careful yourself later.</font></font>

507
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You should be a bit better off.</font></font>

508
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Safety first.</font></font>

509
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go get me a bottle of water.</font></font>

510
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

511
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Happy to be of service]
Of course, my dream girl.</font></font>

512
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Delighted]</font></font>

513
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I opened it for you.</font></font>

514
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

515
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

516
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The red team scored two points,</font></font>

517
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the green team scored one.</font></font>

518
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations, red team. You're in the final.</font></font>

519
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Red team advances to the final]</font></font>

520
00:17:56,320 --> 00:17:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations!</font></font>

521
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay. We'll get another chance to go out.</font></font>

522
00:17:59,440 --> 00:17:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There'll be more.</font></font>

523
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll all leave in six days anyway.</font></font>

524
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seven, isn't it?</font></font>

525
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only seven days until we leave.</font></font>

526
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

527
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only seven days left with my dream girl.</font></font>

528
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Three-Person Soccer: First half, match 2]</font></font>

529
