<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang, Liu Yuning, Zhang Yi vs. Zheng Shoudong, Hu Ke'er]</font></font>

530
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have a request.</font></font>

531
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you give us a thirty-second head start?</font></font>

532
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just thirty seconds.</font></font>

533
00:18:13,520 --> 00:18:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can't play soccer.</font></font>

534
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't run rings around us, okay?</font></font>

535
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

536
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Respect the spirit of competition]</font></font>

537
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm honestly scared.</font></font>

538
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's fine.</font></font>

539
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Offering reassurance]
Just enjoy the game, okay?</font></font>

540
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Holding his arm]</font></font>

541
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Can't get a grip]</font></font>

542
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His arm's too big. I can't get my hand around it.</font></font>

543
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Three.</font></font>

544
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two.</font></font>

545
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One.</font></font>

546
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let the match begin!</font></font>

547
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang gets the ball]</font></font>

548
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A direct kick]</font></font>

549
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wide of the goal]</font></font>

550
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Almost.</font></font>

551
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Holding on]</font></font>

552
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I'm holding everyone up]</font></font>

553
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You need to stand farther back.</font></font>

554
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Play resumes]</font></font>

555
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Placing it by his feet]</font></font>

556
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wide of the goal]</font></font>

557
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That wasn't even close.</font></font>

558
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Best thrower.</font></font>

559
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Tossing it to his feet]</font></font>

560
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait a second.</font></font>

561
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Time for a big kick.</font></font>

562
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait a second.</font></font>

563
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:48,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That doesn't count.</font></font>

564
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong misses twice in a row]</font></font>

565
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I gave you a chance, and you blew it.</font></font>

566
00:20:00,120 --> 00:20:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Still tied at 0-0...]</font></font>

567
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Making their own entertainment]</font></font>

568
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is basically sword dancing in the rain again.</font></font>

569
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise, I'd just be sitting here watching.</font></font>

570
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Watching you two is no fun.</font></font>

571
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's so boring.</font></font>

572
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bro, can you speed things up?</font></font>

573
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll never finish today.</font></font>

574
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We could keep this up for twenty minutes.</font></font>

575
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Play resumes]</font></font>

576
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

577
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong gets the ball]</font></font>

578
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Still no goal]</font></font>

579
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His feet are too long.</font></font>

580
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

581
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Careful.</font></font>

582
00:20:42,040 --> 00:20:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Time's up]</font></font>

583
00:20:42,960 --> 00:20:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As the scores are tied,</font></font>

584
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll now have a penalty shootout.</font></font>

585
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Each team will send one player to take a penalty.</font></font>

586
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The first team to score wins a place in the final.</font></font>

587
00:20:51,360 --> 00:20:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang takes the first penalty]</font></font>

588
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang scores his penalty]</font></font>

589
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's so easy.</font></font>

590
00:21:12,600 --> 00:21:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Penalties are much more fun.</font></font>

591
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So easy.</font></font>

592
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong takes his penalty]</font></font>

593
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Penalty missed]</font></font>

594
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Yellow team advances to the final]</font></font>

595
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But we still can't beat Wang Sheng's team.</font></font>

596
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll just hand them the win.</font></font>

597
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Victory in sight]</font></font>

598
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've wanted to get off the island so badly,</font></font>

599
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but there goes that chance.</font></font>

600
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are we the losers' bracket?</font></font>

601
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're the losers.</font></font>

602
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[There's always next time]
Our next trip out is in seven days.</font></font>

603
00:21:58,040 --> 00:21:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm already prepared for that.</font></font>

604
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could you take a look at my...</font></font>

605
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my Love & Bread story?</font></font>

606
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I'll buy everyone</font></font>

607
00:22:03,360 --> 00:22:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">access to yours.</font></font>

608
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why? You can only buy one.</font></font>

609
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want everyone to see,</font></font>

610
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can invite them to watch together.</font></font>

611
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Invite everyone to watch together.</font></font>

612
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

613
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can only watch it once.</font></font>

614
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Getting up to join Liu Xinran]</font></font>

615
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's do this.</font></font>

616
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's do this.</font></font>

617
00:22:21,600 --> 00:22:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Standing obediently behind Liu Xinran]</font></font>

618
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You catch on fast.</font></font>

619
00:22:25,720 --> 00:22:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sitting on her lap?</font></font>

620
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on?</font></font>

621
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sitting on my owner's lap, right?</font></font>

622
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think he's pretty funny.</font></font>

623
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's like me.</font></font>

624
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll suddenly do something unexpected.</font></font>

625
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think he's a bit like that too.</font></font>

626
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The final showdown: Plank of Love.</font></font>

627
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To complete the challenge,</font></font>

628
00:22:42,560 --> 00:22:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Plank of Love: Rules]
everyone must stay on the plank</font></font>

629
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">until the time is up.</font></font>

630
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[If anyone touches the ground]
If anyone touches the ground,</font></font>

631
00:22:48,480 --> 00:22:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Challenge failed]
your team fails.</font></font>

632
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After completing all three planks,</font></font>

633
00:22:51,760 --> 00:22:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[First team to take the flag wins]
the first team to grab the flag</font></font>

634
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will be the overall winner.</font></font>

635
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This looks fun.</font></font>

636
00:22:59,120 --> 00:23:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't this one of those puzzle games?</font></font>

637
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You kneel down.</font></font>

638
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Offering advice]
See that gap there?</font></font>

639
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stand in the gap between his legs.</font></font>

640
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, exactly.</font></font>

641
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then straighten your body.</font></font>

642
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then she stands between your legs.</font></font>

643
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You stand between his legs.</font></font>

644
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're guaranteed to win like that.</font></font>

645
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Newfound respect]</font></font>

646
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's genius.</font></font>

647
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Trying it out]
How do we position ourselves?</font></font>

648
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's try it first.</font></font>

649
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Plank size: 28 cm x 20 cm]</font></font>

650
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You get on first.</font></font>

651
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Holding on]</font></font>

652
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, move your feet forward.</font></font>

653
00:23:19,760 --> 00:23:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Use as much of the space as you can.</font></font>

654
00:23:21,840 --> 00:23:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[All three hold on tight]</font></font>

655
00:23:23,320 --> 00:23:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So high up.</font></font>

656
