<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[An awkward height difference]</font></font>

658
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ke can't stop laughing again.</font></font>

659
