<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Successfully balanced]</font></font>

660
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can do this. No problem.</font></font>

661
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Kneeling before his owner]
Does this work?</font></font>

662
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does this work?</font></font>

663
00:23:33,360 --> 00:23:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, that works.</font></font>

664
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Unbeatable.</font></font>

665
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lean your weight on me.</font></font>

666
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, no more demonstrations for them.</font></font>

667
00:23:43,280 --> 00:23:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, unbeatable.</font></font>

668
00:23:44,080 --> 00:23:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Secretly taking notes]</font></font>

669
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A new idea]
I'll just stay on his shoulders.</font></font>

670
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Try it first, okay?</font></font>

671
00:23:55,320 --> 00:23:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now it's basically just two of us</font></font>

672
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">playing this game.</font></font>

673
00:23:58,320 --> 00:23:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold me a little tighter, okay?</font></font>

674
00:23:59,840 --> 00:24:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Grabbing his hair]</font></font>

675
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where should I hold on?</font></font>

676
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So where should I hold on?</font></font>

677
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A chokehold]
His neck.</font></font>

678
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where should I hold on?</font></font>

679
00:24:12,520 --> 00:24:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Grab your ears.</font></font>

680
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where should I hold on?</font></font>

681
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've fused into one.</font></font>

682
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Three become one]
Okay, like this.</font></font>

683
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah. Is that okay?</font></font>

684
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is this okay?</font></font>

685
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Should be fine.</font></font>

686
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is this okay? Are you steady?</font></font>

687
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rock solid.</font></font>

688
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, that's really steady.</font></font>

689
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Carrying her like that is really stable.</font></font>

690
00:24:26,360 --> 00:24:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No need to get down. Stay there.</font></font>

691
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've already won today.</font></font>

692
00:24:29,840 --> 00:24:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Stage two: Yellow, red and orange teams]</font></font>

693
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">On your knees.</font></font>

694
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Command: Kneel]</font></font>

695
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Message received]</font></font>

696
