<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The Princess and Her Knight]</font></font>

697
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A sudden change of mood]</font></font>

698
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Three, two, one, go!</font></font>

699
00:24:49,520 --> 00:24:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Put one foot on his foot.</font></font>

700
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Both feet on his feet]</font></font>

701
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Yang carries the whole team]</font></font>

702
00:24:53,600 --> 00:24:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Holding on with both hands]</font></font>

703
00:24:54,760 --> 00:24:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold on to her.</font></font>

704
00:24:55,840 --> 00:24:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on, you two get on first.</font></font>

705
00:24:57,480 --> 00:24:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A three-person huddle]</font></font>

706
00:24:58,440 --> 00:25:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Holding on tight]</font></font>

707
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Cai Ziyi's foot is still on the ground]</font></font>

708
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't. I can't fit on.</font></font>

709
00:25:07,080 --> 00:25:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[One foot on Wang Sheng's foot]</font></font>

710
00:25:14,800 --> 00:25:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stay steady.</font></font>

711
00:25:15,360 --> 00:25:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm scared.</font></font>

712
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold his head. Grab his head.</font></font>

713
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

714
00:25:19,640 --> 00:25:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A jawline-shaped handrail]</font></font>

715
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A free jawline lift.</font></font>

716
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Start the countdown.</font></font>

717
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Everyone is on the plank]</font></font>

718
00:25:25,760 --> 00:25:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Totally relaxed]
Sipping coffee, enjoying the breeze.</font></font>

719
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Time's up.</font></font>

720
00:25:48,800 --> 00:25:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Great!</font></font>

721
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That looks so fun. I want a go.</font></font>

722
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Me too. I really want to try.</font></font>

723
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But we didn't qualify.</font></font>

724
00:25:53,360 --> 00:25:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wish this had been the first round.</font></font>

725
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've still got plenty of space.</font></font>

726
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look.</font></font>

727
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Huang Siyang lifted me onto his shoulders.</font></font>

728
00:25:58,600 --> 00:25:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That way,</font></font>

729
00:25:59,240 --> 00:26:01,480
