730
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was for two people's feet.</font></font>

731
00:26:03,320 --> 00:26:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's like competing with just two people.</font></font>

732
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Compared with having three people's feet</font></font>

733
00:26:06,320 --> 00:26:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on the plank at once,</font></font>

734
00:26:06,920 --> 00:26:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we needed much less space.</font></font>

735
00:26:10,680 --> 00:26:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Challenge complete.</font></font>

736
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now we'll move on to the next plank.</font></font>

737
00:26:13,840 --> 00:26:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[First plank: 20 cm x 28 cm]</font></font>

738
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Second plank: 22 cm x 21 cm]</font></font>

739
00:26:16,120 --> 00:26:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's use our secret weapon.</font></font>

740
00:26:16,960 --> 00:26:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kneel.</font></font>

741
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's do this.</font></font>

742
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He insists on kneeling.</font></font>

743
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He just likes kneeling.</font></font>

744
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Same as before.</font></font>

745
00:26:25,360 --> 00:26:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A winning move]
No laughing this time.</font></font>

746
00:26:27,080 --> 00:26:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think we should copy them.</font></font>

747
00:26:28,320 --> 00:26:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Copying the yellow team]
He carries her,</font></font>

748
00:26:28,800 --> 00:26:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the other girl stands in front</font></font>

749
00:26:30,080 --> 00:26:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with her feet on his.</font></font>

750
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's only room for one guy to stand on this.</font></font>

751
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

752
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Only room for one person]</font></font>

753
00:26:35,640 --> 00:26:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ready.</font></font>

754
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Three.</font></font>

755
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two.</font></font>

756
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She wants me to carry her in my arms.</font></font>

757
00:26:40,720 --> 00:26:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just stand in front of me.</font></font>

758
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One.</font></font>

759
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Standing steady]</font></font>

760
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get on. Quick, get on.</font></font>

761
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold his head.</font></font>

762
00:26:52,240 --> 00:26:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll hold your legs.</font></font>

763
00:26:57,120 --> 00:26:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm stepping on your foot.</font></font>

764
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get on. I'm steady. Yeah.</font></font>

765
00:27:09,080 --> 00:27:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wang Sheng.</font></font>

766
00:27:21,560 --> 00:27:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Using their secret weapon]</font></font>

767
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

768
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, put your knee on his foot.</font></font>

769
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, just like that.</font></font>

770
00:27:33,280 --> 00:27:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Beautiful.</font></font>

771
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And they're strong.</font></font>

772
