<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wobbling]</font></font>

773
00:27:37,240 --> 00:27:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, hold on to me.</font></font>

