00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's kneeling too far forward.</font></font>

779
00:27:53,520 --> 00:27:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hang on.</font></font>

780
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, you need to get on, bro.</font></font>

781
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hang on.</font></font>

782
00:27:56,360 --> 00:27:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Knee pad caught on the plank]</font></font>

783
00:27:58,280 --> 00:28:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me lift that foot a little higher.</font></font>

784
00:28:02,040 --> 00:28:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't lift it.</font></font>

785
00:28:03,760 --> 00:28:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Start the countdown.</font></font>

786
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The countdown begins]
Start the countdown.</font></font>

787
00:28:17,880 --> 00:28:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think his knee pad touched the ground.</font></font>

788
00:28:19,240 --> 00:28:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The knee pad.</font></font>

789
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Orange team is out]
Wang Tianqing's knee touched the ground.</font></font>

790
00:28:27,800 --> 00:28:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The orange team has failed.</font></font>

791
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So close.</font></font>

792
00:28:29,760 --> 00:28:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Goodbye. No off-island date for us.</font></font>

793
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's such a shame our team didn't win.</font></font>

794
00:28:35,240 --> 00:28:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The princess wants to go out]
Of course I wanted it. Who wouldn't?</font></font>

795
00:28:38,120 --> 00:28:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I did get to go out,</font></font>

796
00:28:39,480 --> 00:28:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd definitely invite Tianqing.</font></font>

797
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations to the yellow and red teams.</font></font>

798
00:28:44,520 --> 00:28:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've made it to the last round.</font></font>

799
00:28:45,520 --> 00:28:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do we manage the next plank?</font></font>

800
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's another one?</font></font>

801
00:28:48,320 --> 00:28:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Remember, after completing this plank,</font></font>

802
00:28:51,280 --> 00:28:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the first team to reach the finish line</font></font>

803
00:28:52,520 --> 00:28:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and grab the flag wins.</font></font>

804
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Third plank: 21 cm x 11 cm]</font></font>

805
00:29:00,080 --> 00:29:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Both teams try it out]
How do we do this?</font></font>

806
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Sticking with the same strategy]</font></font>

807
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does it hurt?</font></font>

808
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

809
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Victory in the bag]
We could have a coffee, honestly.</font></font>

810
00:29:08,840 --> 00:29:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Two try it first]</font></font>

811
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But this is really slippery.</font></font>

812
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

813
00:29:12,120 --> 00:29:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll leave you some room in the middle.</font></font>

814
00:29:13,080 --> 00:29:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Constant wobbling]
I'll leave you some room in the middle.</font></font>

815
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then put your other foot on mine.</font></font>

816
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

817
00:29:16,120 --> 00:29:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this, I need to move...</font></font>

818
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't balance like this.</font></font>

819
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Put one foot down,</font></font>

820
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then hook your other leg</font></font>

821
00:29:21,280 --> 00:29:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">right around me, okay?</font></font>

822
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this.</font></font>

823
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this.</font></font>

824
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this.</font></font>

825
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Koala.</font></font>

826
00:29:41,040 --> 00:29:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Enjoying the show]</font></font>

827
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wang Sheng, try not to smile so much.</font></font>

828
00:29:50,560 --> 00:29:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Escaping the sweetness]</font></font>

829
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This game is way too easy.</font></font>

830
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The most relaxing competition]</font></font>

831
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, don't mess up my hair.</font></font>

832
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Final: Huang Siyang, Liu Yuning, Zhang Yi vs. Ren Chunxi, Cai Ziyi, Wang Sheng]</font></font>

833
00:30:01,960 --> 00:30:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Three, two, one.</font></font>

834
00:30:04,800 --> 00:30:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go!</font></font>

835
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The deciding round begins]</font></font>

836
00:30:12,760 --> 00:30:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Getting the hang of it]</font></font>

837
00:30:15,280 --> 00:30:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Steady as a pine]</font></font>

838
00:30:16,840 --> 00:30:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This position is still the most stable.</font></font>

839
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[An unstable base]</font></font>

840
00:30:21,320 --> 00:30:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Engage your core.</font></font>

841
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just wrap your arms around his head.</font></font>

842
00:30:23,360 --> 00:30:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lower your center of gravity a little.</font></font>

843
00:30:25,360 --> 00:30:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hang on.</font></font>

844
00:30:28,680 --> 00:30:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hang on. Don't move yet.</font></font>

845
00:30:45,560 --> 00:30:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Start the countdown.</font></font>

846
00:30:47,520 --> 00:30:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ren Chunxi, you run ahead.</font></font>

847
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry about us.</font></font>

848
00:30:55,120 --> 00:30:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

849
00:31:00,360 --> 00:31:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't run!</font></font>

850
00:31:01,760 --> 00:31:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't run!</font></font>

851
00:31:03,280 --> 00:31:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Huang Siyang!</font></font>

852
00:31:06,480 --> 00:31:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Blocking his path]</font></font>

853
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This isn't an individual event.</font></font>

854
00:31:09,080 --> 00:31:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a team event.</font></font>

855
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want to let my teammates down.</font></font>

856
00:31:11,600 --> 00:31:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So when I felt my leg</font></font>

857
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wasn't hurting that much,</font></font>

858
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to give it everything for them.</font></font>

859
00:31:17,280 --> 00:31:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't run!</font></font>

860
00:31:23,760 --> 00:31:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ren Chunxi grabs the flag: Red team wins]</font></font>

861
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The competition is over]</font></font>

862
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So close.</font></font>

863
00:31:38,320 --> 00:31:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sorry about that.</font></font>

864
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's fine.</font></font>

865
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well done.</font></font>

866
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not at all.</font></font>

867
00:31:41,600 --> 00:31:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were a wonderful knight.</font></font>

868
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Knight]
Thank you.</font></font>

869
00:31:43,840 --> 00:31:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well done.</font></font>

870
00:31:45,600 --> 00:31:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That knee slide at the end was amazing.</font></font>

871
00:31:47,320 --> 00:31:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pretty cool.</font></font>

872
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That was epic, Xixi!</font></font>

873
00:31:50,080 --> 00:31:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Incredible.</font></font>

874
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even with a twisted knee,</font></font>

875
00:31:52,600 --> 00:31:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it didn't slow her down.</font></font>

876
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well done.</font></font>

877
00:31:55,640 --> 00:31:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really impressive.</font></font>

878
00:31:57,320 --> 00:31:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Envious]
Live my dream for me.</font></font>

879
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Today's competition went pretty well.</font></font>

880
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We won in the end,</font></font>

881
00:32:06,200 --> 00:32:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so it was a great result.</font></font>

882
00:32:07,760 --> 00:32:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A happy ending.</font></font>

883
00:32:08,760 --> 00:32:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">An off-island date!</font></font>

884
00:32:09,680 --> 00:32:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think that was really fun.</font></font>

885
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wang Sheng finally won one.</font></font>

886
00:32:13,720 --> 00:32:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His first win.</font></font>

887
00:32:14,720 --> 00:32:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And it's an off-island date.</font></font>

888
00:32:18,840 --> 00:32:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Still in last place.</font></font>

889
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I barely have any points.</font></font>

890
00:32:21,360 --> 00:32:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

891
00:32:22,040 --> 00:32:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who cares? You can't buy food with them anyway.</font></font>

892
00:32:23,800 --> 00:32:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

893
00:32:24,560 --> 00:32:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't even know what food they have.</font></font>

894
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't been there yet.</font></font>

895
00:32:30,120 --> 00:32:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Was your knee okay just now?</font></font>

896
00:32:32,160 --> 00:32:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The adrenaline kicked in.</font></font>

897
00:32:34,240 --> 00:32:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All I wanted was to win.</font></font>

898
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just love winning, you know?</font></font>

899
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Never lost.</font></font>

900
00:32:41,600 --> 00:32:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations to Ren Chunxi, Wang Sheng</font></font>

901
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and Cai Ziyi, our first-place team.</font></font>

902
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[1st: Ren Chunxi, Cai Ziyi, Wang Sheng; 10 survival points each]</font></font>

903
00:32:46,240 --> 00:32:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Yellow team: 2nd, 5 points each]
Each of you</font></font>

904
00:32:46,880 --> 00:32:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang, Liu Yuning, Zhang Yi]
get an off-island date invitation.</font></font>

905
00:32:49,320 --> 00:32:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Orange: 3rd, 3 survival points each]
You may take turns visiting</font></font>

906
00:32:51,120 --> 00:32:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Blue and green: 4th, 2 points each]
the Supply Station of Affection</font></font>

907
00:32:52,080 --> 00:32:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Blue and green team members]
to make your invitations.</font></font>

908
00:32:54,600 --> 00:32:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we're winning, we're winning big.</font></font>

909
00:32:55,360 --> 00:32:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

910
00:33:00,560 --> 00:33:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course I'm disappointed,</font></font>

911
00:33:01,520 --> 00:33:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I'm at peace with it.</font></font>

912
00:33:02,760 --> 00:33:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I accept the result.</font></font>

913
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My teammates all worked so hard.</font></font>

914
00:33:05,640 --> 00:33:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as we tried, that's enough.</font></font>

915
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll let this one go.</font></font>

916
00:33:08,840 --> 00:33:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm definitely winning next time.</font></font>

917
00:33:11,240 --> 00:33:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

918
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That was so much fun.</font></font>

919
00:33:17,040 --> 00:33:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go first.</font></font>

920
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Heading to the Supply Station of Affection]</font></font>

921
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Going off the island lets us find out</font></font>

922
00:33:37,040 --> 00:33:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">more about each other's real lives,</font></font>

923
00:33:37,840 --> 00:33:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then reassess our relationship</font></font>

924
00:33:39,560 --> 00:33:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and how I feel about him.</font></font>

925
00:33:42,040 --> 00:33:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wang Sheng]</font></font>

926
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your date invitation has been received.</font></font>

927
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Two islanders waiting to choose their dates]</font></font>

928
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Pacing]</font></font>

929
00:33:57,320 --> 00:33:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do you hate me so much?</font></font>

930
00:33:58,800 --> 00:33:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't hate you.</font></font>

931
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When have I ever hated you?</font></font>

932
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You haven't given me a single Moonstone these past two days.</font></font>

933
00:34:04,760 --> 00:34:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We even partnered up for the photo shoot.</font></font>

934
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want to vote for you.</font></font>

935
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I didn't want to vote for you]
Why?</font></font>

936
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was upset.</font></font>

937
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wondered if I should apologize,</font></font>

938
00:34:12,240 --> 00:34:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but they said,</font></font>

939
00:34:14,360 --> 00:34:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Who do you think you are, Wang Sheng?"</font></font>

940
00:34:16,120 --> 00:34:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

941
00:34:16,600 --> 00:34:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't think my being upset was your fault.</font></font>

942
00:34:18,960 --> 00:34:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just felt a little hurt.</font></font>

943
00:34:22,560 --> 00:34:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Was it because that day,</font></font>

944
00:34:23,600 --> 00:34:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you kept talking to me,</font></font>

945
00:34:24,760 --> 00:34:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I didn't really start conversations?</font></font>

946
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Or was it because I later chose</font></font>

947
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to get to know Ren Chunxi?</font></font>

948
00:34:29,920 --> 00:34:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Which was it?</font></font>

949
00:34:31,080 --> 00:34:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The latter.</font></font>

950
00:34:31,560 --> 00:34:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The latter: Choosing to get to know Ren Chunxi]</font></font>

951
00:34:35,600 --> 00:34:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry. I understand.</font></font>

952
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't keep getting in the way of you two.</font></font>

953
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to...</font></font>

954
00:34:40,040 --> 00:34:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't keep trying to please everyone.</font></font>

955
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right, that's why I said</font></font>

956
00:34:43,520 --> 00:34:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was okay afterward.</font></font>

957
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't I keep chatting with you after that?</font></font>

958
00:34:46,680 --> 00:34:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't control these things.</font></font>

959
00:34:49,600 --> 00:34:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just wanted to explain.</font></font>

960
00:34:51,160 --> 00:34:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No excuses. I'm sorry.</font></font>

961
00:34:53,200 --> 00:34:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I owe you an apology for the other day.</font></font>

962
00:34:54,400 --> 00:34:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry I upset you.</font></font>

963
00:34:55,240 --> 00:34:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Apology accepted.</font></font>

964
00:35:00,160 --> 00:35:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go now. Bye.</font></font>

965
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go on. Bye.</font></font>

966
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ren Chunxi.</font></font>

967
00:35:24,240 --> 00:35:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I couldn't invite anyone else.</font></font>

968
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether she chooses me or not,</font></font>

969
00:35:26,720 --> 00:35:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll definitely choose her.</font></font>

970
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I choose Xixi.</font></font>

971
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xixi]</font></font>

972
00:35:43,120 --> 00:35:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hadn't won anything before.</font></font>

973
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This one mattered. I had to win.</font></font>

974
00:36:00,040 --> 00:36:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But once I won,</font></font>

975
00:36:02,200 --> 00:36:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it was frustrating. I didn't know who to pick.</font></font>

976
00:36:08,240 --> 00:36:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Torn]</font></font>

977
00:36:16,720 --> 00:36:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'll probably be surprised.</font></font>

978
00:36:20,680 --> 00:36:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Secret]</font></font>

979
00:36:28,200 --> 00:36:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

980
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well...</font></font>

981
00:36:31,640 --> 00:36:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ziyi was a bit upset</font></font>

982
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because I didn't choose her.</font></font>

983
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But she understands now.</font></font>

984
00:36:37,040 --> 00:36:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had to make a choice,</font></font>

985
00:36:38,160 --> 00:36:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I still gave her</font></font>

986
00:36:39,680 --> 00:36:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the wrong impression.</font></font>

987
00:36:41,920 --> 00:36:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know I didn't handle things well that day.</font></font>

988
00:36:43,160 --> 00:36:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She was upset,</font></font>

989
00:36:44,400 --> 00:36:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and it made things awkward in their room.</font></font>

990
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could you take this over for me?</font></font>

991
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ice cream as an apology]
I can't really give it to her myself.</font></font>

992
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To who?</font></font>

993
00:36:49,120 --> 00:36:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ziyi.</font></font>

994
00:36:49,800 --> 00:36:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What should I say when I give it to her?</font></font>

995
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just say...</font></font>

996
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">something like,</font></font>

997
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"There was ice cream in the kitchen.</font></font>

998
00:36:55,640 --> 00:36:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only a few left.</font></font>

999
00:36:56,360 --> 00:36:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Our room's had some. This one's for you."</font></font>

1000
00:36:59,240 --> 00:37:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For Ziyi, right?</font></font>

1001
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For Ke, right?</font></font>

1002
00:37:03,400 --> 00:37:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll tell her it's from Wang Sheng.</font></font>

1003
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't do that.</font></font>

1004
00:37:07,520 --> 00:37:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want me to do?</font></font>

1005
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You absolutely can't say it's from me.</font></font>

1006
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

1007
00:37:10,560 --> 00:37:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[At a loss]
That'll only give her the wrong idea.</font></font>

1008
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to say sorry.</font></font>

1009
00:37:14,040 --> 00:37:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But she doesn't need to know it's from me.</font></font>

1010
00:37:15,520 --> 00:37:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you should go yourself.</font></font>

1011
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You need to talk to her yourself</font></font>

1012
00:37:19,440 --> 00:37:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and clear things up.</font></font>

1013
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have to face this yourself.</font></font>

1014
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're going to choose Qian Shihan...</font></font>

1015
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get out of here.</font></font>

1016
00:37:27,640 --> 00:37:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If even you think</font></font>

1017
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">something's wrong,</font></font>

1018
00:37:30,600 --> 00:37:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then there's clearly an issue between you.</font></font>

1019
00:37:32,560 --> 00:37:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're just onlookers.</font></font>

1020
00:37:33,680 --> 00:37:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We don't really know</font></font>

1021
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what happened between you two.</font></font>

1022
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you should talk to her</font></font>

1023
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and clear it up.</font></font>

1024
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, but I'm worried it'll melt.</font></font>

1025
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll stand beside you and help, okay?</font></font>

1026
00:37:46,240 --> 00:37:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Passing by]</font></font>

1027
00:37:47,600 --> 00:37:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel a bit guilty now.</font></font>

1028
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't even look at the person I chose.</font></font>

1029
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you could say...</font></font>

1030
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Spots Cai Ziyi]
If you say it like that, do you think...</font></font>

1031
00:37:53,720 --> 00:37:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cai.</font></font>

1032
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

1033
00:37:56,040 --> 00:37:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come over here a little.</font></font>

1034
00:37:58,160 --> 00:37:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hiding it behind his back]</font></font>

1035
00:38:03,680 --> 00:38:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Come on, spit it out]</font></font>

1036
00:38:04,640 --> 00:38:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">About the other day...</font></font>

1037
00:38:06,080 --> 00:38:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to apologize.</font></font>

1038
00:38:06,640 --> 00:38:07,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Another apology?]
I know, you just apologized.</font></font>

1039
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No need to do it again.</font></font>

1040
00:38:09,520 --> 00:38:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've got an extra ice cream.</font></font>

1041
00:38:11,600 --> 00:38:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Would you like it?</font></font>

1042
00:38:12,080 --> 00:38:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not an extra.</font></font>

1043
00:38:12,640 --> 00:38:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He got it especially for you.</font></font>

1044
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He feels really bad about the other day.</font></font>

1045
00:38:15,920 --> 00:38:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He just feels bad about it.</font></font>

1046
00:38:17,120 --> 00:38:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And...</font></font>

1047
00:38:17,480 --> 00:38:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Happy]
Really? Give it here.</font></font>

1048
00:38:19,040 --> 00:38:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt I owed you an explanation.</font></font>

1049
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

1050
00:38:21,240 --> 00:38:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

1051
00:38:22,520 --> 00:38:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This one's good.</font></font>

1052
00:38:23,600 --> 00:38:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

1053
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're completely forgiven. Bye!</font></font>

1054
00:38:28,160 --> 00:38:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good job. There you go.</font></font>

1055
00:38:29,560 --> 00:38:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Much appreciated.</font></font>

1056
00:38:33,480 --> 00:38:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether we're friends</font></font>

1057
00:38:35,560 --> 00:38:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or whatever happens,</font></font>

1058
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think we should let things happen naturally.</font></font>

1059
00:38:42,920 --> 00:38:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ziyi has such a lovely personality.</font></font>

1060
00:38:44,600 --> 00:38:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She doesn't...</font></font>

1061
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hide how she feels.</font></font>

1062
00:38:46,560 --> 00:38:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">...hide how she feels.</font></font>

1063
00:38:48,040 --> 00:38:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Cai Ziyi: Yay, ice cream!]</font></font>

1064
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A sincere heart deserves forgiveness]</font></font>

1065
00:38:54,080 --> 00:38:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Today's challenge was pretty tough.</font></font>

1066
00:38:55,920 --> 00:38:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm actually not that good at sports.</font></font>

1067
00:38:57,720 --> 00:38:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you seemed to be in great form.</font></font>

1068
00:38:59,800 --> 00:39:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really steady.</font></font>

1069
00:39:00,360 --> 00:39:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you stay so full of energy?</font></font>

1070
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I go to Xiuyu regularly</font></font>

1071
00:39:03,600 --> 00:39:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for AI-powered robotic matrix-wave treatments.</font></font>

1072
00:39:05,840 --> 00:39:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No wonder you look so relaxed and light on your feet.</font></font>

1073
00:39:08,200 --> 00:39:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, Xiuyu is a major brand.</font></font>

1074
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They've specialized in wellness care for 21 years.</font></font>

1075
00:39:12,240 --> 00:39:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They also officially sponsor women's basketball.</font></font>

1076
00:39:14,320 --> 00:39:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The treatments help my body relax,</font></font>

1077
00:39:16,640 --> 00:39:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I feel better overall.</font></font>

1078
00:39:17,760 --> 00:39:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Definitely.</font></font>

1079
00:39:18,160 --> 00:39:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you feel better, you look more energetic too.</font></font>

1080
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Looks like staying in good shape</font></font>

1081
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">means getting regular treatments.</font></font>

1082
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll try Xiuyu once we leave the island.</font></font>

1083
00:39:25,640 --> 00:39:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go together, then.</font></font>

1084
00:39:26,520 --> 00:39:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

1085
00:39:28,640 --> 00:39:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Gao Yuheng: A nap, then a date with my dream girl]</font></font>

1086
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll have a nap,</font></font>

1087
00:39:31,160 --> 00:39:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then a date with my dream girl.</font></font>

1088
00:39:33,440 --> 00:39:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you two ever</font></font>

1089
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">gone for a walk alone or something?</font></font>

1090
00:39:36,480 --> 00:39:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

1091
00:39:37,040 --> 00:39:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know what to say, you know?</font></font>

1092
00:39:38,680 --> 00:39:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got to do that, though.</font></font>

1093
00:39:40,120 --> 00:39:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How else can she get to know you?</font></font>

1094
00:39:41,080 --> 00:39:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She only knows you as a show-off, bro.</font></font>

1095
00:39:43,200 --> 00:39:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yesterday, with her...</font></font>

1096
00:39:44,520 --> 00:39:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I saw that side of her,</font></font>

1097
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I knew we weren't the same kind of person.</font></font>

1098
00:39:53,320 --> 00:39:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Affection beats everything]
My feelings outweigh her quirks.</font></font>

1099
00:39:55,760 --> 00:39:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I even like her quirks.</font></font>

1100
00:39:57,600 --> 00:39:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't usually go for nonstop energy,</font></font>

1101
00:39:58,600 --> 00:40:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but she can be quiet and lively,</font></font>

1102
00:40:00,200 --> 00:40:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know?</font></font>

1103
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That balance is the cutest thing about her.</font></font>

1104
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So she is...</font></font>

1105
00:40:04,160 --> 00:40:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought she couldn't sit still,</font></font>

1106
00:40:05,120 --> 00:40:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know?</font></font>

1107
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I've realized she has a quiet side too.</font></font>

1108
00:40:09,560 --> 00:40:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So now I like her even more.</font></font>

1109
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She also said</font></font>

1110
00:40:14,480 --> 00:40:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she mostly puts her own feelings first.</font></font>

1111
00:40:16,240 --> 00:40:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1112
00:40:17,240 --> 00:40:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So if I want</font></font>

1113
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">things to go further with her,</font></font>

1114
00:40:20,520 --> 00:40:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd have to make some sacrifices.</font></font>

1115
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I think</font></font>

1116
00:40:24,640 --> 00:40:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that would really affect me.</font></font>

1117
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the kind of person that</font></font>

1118
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">once I start loving someone more,</font></font>

1119
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just keep giving more and more.</font></font>

1120
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I fall deeper and deeper,</font></font>

1121
00:40:34,120 --> 00:40:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and lose more of myself.</font></font>

1122
00:40:37,360 --> 00:40:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's how I used to be.</font></font>

1123
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I really want</font></font>

1124
00:40:41,400 --> 00:40:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">her to watch my relationship story.</font></font>

1125
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did she say she'd show it to all the girls?</font></font>

1126
00:40:46,640 --> 00:40:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't really get it.</font></font>

1127
00:40:48,640 --> 00:40:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe she feels</font></font>

1128
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that way I won't get the wrong idea.</font></font>

1129
00:40:52,880 --> 00:40:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1130
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you can clearly see</font></font>

1131
00:40:54,200 --> 00:40:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what being friends looks like.</font></font>

1132
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

1133
00:40:58,080 --> 00:41:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She just wants</font></font>

1134
00:41:00,160 --> 00:41:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to let you down gently.</font></font>

1135
00:41:02,040 --> 00:41:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

1136
00:41:03,160 --> 00:41:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bro, I'm not stupid.</font></font>

1137
00:41:13,800 --> 00:41:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Congratulations, Ren Chunxi and Wang Sheng.</font></font>

1138
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've chosen each other.</font></font>

1139
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please go to the departure meeting point.</font></font>

1140
00:41:28,280 --> 00:41:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are they taking backpacks?</font></font>

1141
00:41:30,720 --> 00:41:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Envious]</font></font>

1142
00:41:31,240 --> 00:41:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two big bags.</font></font>

1143
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:33,400
