1304
00:48:07,920 --> 00:48:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There are so many restrictions on the island.</font></font>

1305
00:48:10,240 --> 00:48:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to see us in a more real-world setting.</font></font>

1306
00:48:15,560 --> 00:48:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To see what's different, right?</font></font>

1307
00:48:23,120 --> 00:48:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I want to know how old you are.</font></font>

1308
00:48:24,840 --> 00:48:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Asking his age]</font></font>

1309
00:48:25,840 --> 00:48:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My age?</font></font>

1310
00:48:28,640 --> 00:48:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you think?</font></font>

1311
00:48:30,480 --> 00:48:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Twenty-four.</font></font>

1312
00:48:32,560 --> 00:48:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Guessing: 24?]</font></font>

1313
00:48:35,240 --> 00:48:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm twenty-four.</font></font>

1314
00:48:35,760 --> 00:48:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wang Sheng, 24]</font></font>

1315
00:48:36,640 --> 00:48:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm 24, yes.</font></font>

1316
00:48:37,840 --> 00:48:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Born in 2002?</font></font>

1317
00:48:39,040 --> 00:48:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1318
00:48:39,760 --> 00:48:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">January. I'm an Aquarius.</font></font>

1319
00:48:41,960 --> 00:48:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about you?</font></font>

1320
00:48:42,760 --> 00:48:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was born in 2002 too.</font></font>

1321
00:48:43,640 --> 00:48:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The same age]</font></font>

1322
00:48:44,440 --> 00:48:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a little older than you, right?</font></font>

1323
00:48:46,040 --> 00:48:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just by a few months.</font></font>

1324
00:48:48,400 --> 00:48:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was born in September.</font></font>

1325
00:48:50,520 --> 00:48:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Over half a year, then.</font></font>

1326
00:48:57,240 --> 00:48:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Starting a conversation]
What did you think I did?</font></font>

1327
00:48:58,960 --> 00:49:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For work?</font></font>

1328
00:49:00,080 --> 00:49:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something in science or engineering.</font></font>

1329
00:49:03,080 --> 00:49:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A science major.</font></font>

1330
00:49:04,120 --> 00:49:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">An engineering guy, right?</font></font>

1331
00:49:04,840 --> 00:49:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1332
00:49:06,800 --> 00:49:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why? Am I too blunt?</font></font>

1333
00:49:08,880 --> 00:49:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just have that kind of look.</font></font>

1334
00:49:10,680 --> 00:49:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's the impression I get.</font></font>

1335
00:49:11,520 --> 00:49:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And the way you dress...</font></font>

1336
00:49:13,880 --> 00:49:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Like a math major]
You look like you study math.</font></font>

1337
00:49:16,120 --> 00:49:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A math major.</font></font>

1338
00:49:16,840 --> 00:49:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You look like one too.</font></font>

1339
00:49:18,480 --> 00:49:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take that as a compliment.</font></font>

1340
00:49:20,080 --> 00:49:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Math is hard.</font></font>

1341
00:49:20,960 --> 00:49:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I look like a good student?</font></font>

1342
00:49:22,320 --> 00:49:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1343
00:49:23,160 --> 00:49:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I were good at math,</font></font>

1344
00:49:24,160 --> 00:49:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd have studied it.</font></font>

1345
00:49:28,120 --> 00:49:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So what did you study?</font></font>

1346
00:49:29,440 --> 00:49:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My major?</font></font>

1347
00:49:31,080 --> 00:49:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is it related to your job now?</font></font>

1348
00:49:32,280 --> 00:49:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not at all.</font></font>

1349
00:49:33,280 --> 00:49:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Occupation: Model]
I work with a modeling agency.</font></font>

1350
00:49:36,200 --> 00:49:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're a model?</font></font>

1351
00:49:39,120 --> 00:49:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">More or less.</font></font>

1352
00:49:39,920 --> 00:49:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never trained for it.</font></font>

1353
00:49:41,840 --> 00:49:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'd make a good model.</font></font>

1354
00:49:43,440 --> 00:49:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

1355
00:49:45,640 --> 00:49:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I used to do some modeling too.</font></font>

1356
00:49:48,280 --> 00:49:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Similar work experience]</font></font>

1357
00:49:49,440 --> 00:49:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In Shanghai?</font></font>

1358
00:49:50,480 --> 00:49:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not in Shanghai.</font></font>

1359
00:49:51,160 --> 00:49:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I remember you modeled abroad.</font></font>

1360
00:49:52,480 --> 00:49:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, in London.</font></font>

1361
00:49:53,680 --> 00:49:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was annoying. Such a waste of time.</font></font>

1362
00:49:56,840 --> 00:49:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I really didn't like</font></font>

1363
00:49:58,760 --> 00:49:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">being treated like merchandise</font></font>

1364
00:49:59,680 --> 00:50:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for people to pick and choose.</font></font>

1365
00:50:04,320 --> 00:50:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait, shouldn't you ask about me?</font></font>

1366
00:50:06,320 --> 00:50:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ask what I study.</font></font>

1367
00:50:08,080 --> 00:50:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fashion design.</font></font>

1368
00:50:09,520 --> 00:50:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not quite.</font></font>

1369
00:50:11,880 --> 00:50:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That was my undergraduate major.</font></font>

1370
00:50:14,080 --> 00:50:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ren Chunxi's major: Accessories design]
Now I study accessories design.</font></font>

1371
00:50:17,880 --> 00:50:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Accessories design.</font></font>

1372
00:50:19,280 --> 00:50:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shoes, bags,</font></font>

1373
00:50:21,320 --> 00:50:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">necklaces, earrings, things like that.</font></font>

1374
00:50:22,960 --> 00:50:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What kind specifically?</font></font>

1375
00:50:24,240 --> 00:50:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Things like bags.</font></font>

1376
00:50:27,840 --> 00:50:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Which university did you go to in Beijing?</font></font>

1377
00:50:30,680 --> 00:50:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">China University of Mining and Technology.</font></font>

1378
00:50:32,640 --> 00:50:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So what was your major?</font></font>

1379
00:50:34,400 --> 00:50:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I studied mining.</font></font>

1380
00:50:35,720 --> 00:50:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[University major: Mining]</font></font>

1381
00:50:36,760 --> 00:50:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mining?</font></font>

1382
00:50:39,000 --> 00:50:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I actually went down into mines.</font></font>

1383
00:50:40,840 --> 00:50:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd wear a helmet</font></font>

1384
00:50:42,160 --> 00:50:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and all the protective gear,</font></font>

1385
00:50:43,680 --> 00:50:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then go hundreds of meters underground.</font></font>

1386
00:50:46,880 --> 00:50:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We really went down there.</font></font>

1387
00:50:48,480 --> 00:50:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Our faces would be completely black when we came up.</font></font>

1388
00:50:51,840 --> 00:50:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then what?</font></font>

1389
00:50:52,280 --> 00:50:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you learn to identify rocks or something?</font></font>

1390
00:50:55,360 --> 00:50:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's down in the mine,</font></font>

1391
00:50:57,240 --> 00:50:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how to lay out the lines, and</font></font>

1392
00:50:59,080 --> 00:51:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how to bring things up.</font></font>

1393
00:51:00,200 --> 00:51:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's pretty complicated.</font></font>

1394
00:51:04,200 --> 00:51:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you like Beijing?</font></font>

1395
00:51:07,680 --> 00:51:09,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was too hot when I went.</font></font>

1396
00:51:09,040 --> 00:51:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The heat made me cranky.</font></font>

1397
00:51:10,880 --> 00:51:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Being outside was so irritating.</font></font>

1398
00:51:13,480 --> 00:51:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because those few days...</font></font>

1399
00:51:14,080 --> 00:51:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Curious]
What are you like when you're angry?</font></font>

1400
00:51:16,080 --> 00:51:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just annoyed.</font></font>

1401
00:51:17,040 --> 00:51:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're always smiling around everyone.</font></font>

1402
00:51:19,960 --> 00:51:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't you stand seeing people happy?</font></font>

1403
00:51:22,040 --> 00:51:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, no, no.</font></font>

1404
00:51:22,760 --> 00:51:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't stand seeing me smile.</font></font>

1405
00:51:24,120 --> 00:51:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1406
00:51:25,360 --> 00:51:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want me to get angry with you,</font></font>

1407
00:51:27,000 --> 00:51:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can do that right now.</font></font>

1408
00:51:31,720 --> 00:51:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where do you live now?</font></font>

1409
00:51:33,520 --> 00:51:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I live in Ningxia.</font></font>

1410
00:51:36,160 --> 00:51:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Home: Ningxia]</font></font>

1411
00:51:38,960 --> 00:51:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you plan to stay there,</font></font>

1412
00:51:41,800 --> 00:51:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or move to another city</font></font>

1413
00:51:43,200 --> 00:51:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and settle down?</font></font>

1414
00:51:46,640 --> 00:51:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a bit like your ex.</font></font>

1415
00:51:49,280 --> 00:51:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was going to Australia, right?</font></font>

1416
00:51:52,600 --> 00:51:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll probably go to Australia too.</font></font>

1417
00:51:53,800 --> 00:51:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Australia again?]</font></font>

1418
00:51:55,000 --> 00:51:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For what? A master's degree?</font></font>

1419
00:51:56,640 --> 00:51:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1420
00:52:03,600 --> 00:52:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why Australia?</font></font>

1421
00:52:04,720 --> 00:52:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is there nowhere else?</font></font>

1422
00:52:06,880 --> 00:52:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've actually always wanted to go there.</font></font>

1423
00:52:09,320 --> 00:52:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've always wanted somewhere</font></font>

1424
00:52:11,200 --> 00:52:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">down-to-earth,</font></font>

1425
00:52:12,160 --> 00:52:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">where I can be more laid-back.</font></font>

1426
00:52:13,320 --> 00:52:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wear my big shorts every day</font></font>

1427
00:52:16,040 --> 00:52:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That does sound like you.</font></font>

1428
00:52:16,720 --> 00:52:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and just wander around.</font></font>

1429
00:52:18,400 --> 00:52:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That does sound like you.</font></font>

1430
00:52:20,120 --> 00:52:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It would probably suit you.</font></font>

1431
00:52:21,240 --> 00:52:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because it's so...</font></font>

1432
00:52:23,280 --> 00:52:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The weather's really nice.</font></font>

1433
00:52:27,000 --> 00:52:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When we were choosing teams,</font></font>

1434
00:52:28,080 --> 00:52:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Asking a question]
why did you choose Ziyi?</font></font>

1435
00:52:29,200 --> 00:52:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because you're close, right?</font></font>

1436
00:52:32,680 --> 00:52:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I forgot to explain.</font></font>

1437
00:52:33,760 --> 00:52:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You didn't bring it up last night,</font></font>

1438
00:52:34,600 --> 00:52:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so we didn't talk about it,</font></font>

1439
00:52:35,680 --> 00:52:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I forgot.</font></font>

1440
00:52:37,000 --> 00:52:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That morning, she wasn't...</font></font>

1441
00:52:38,960 --> 00:52:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't say unhappy,</font></font>

1442
00:52:40,000 --> 00:52:40,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but she felt</font></font>

1443
00:52:40,760 --> 00:52:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she might have to leave.</font></font>

1444
00:52:42,680 --> 00:52:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to cheer her up.</font></font>

1445
00:52:44,600 --> 00:52:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're pretty close,</font></font>

1446
00:52:45,640 --> 00:52:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and in the teams these past few days,</font></font>

1447
00:52:48,040 --> 00:52:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we hadn't had a chance to play together.</font></font>

1448
00:52:49,760 --> 00:52:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted her to feel that someone</font></font>

1449
00:52:54,360 --> 00:52:55,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">cared about her.</font></font>

1450
00:52:55,560 --> 00:52:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I didn't choose her,</font></font>

1451
00:52:57,200 --> 00:52:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and nobody else did,</font></font>

1452
00:52:58,600 --> 00:53:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">being left out would've been awkward.</font></font>

1453
00:53:00,880 --> 00:53:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I understand.</font></font>

1454
00:53:05,880 --> 00:53:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I'm sorry</font></font>

1455
00:53:07,080 --> 00:53:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if that made things awkward for you yesterday.</font></font>

1456
00:53:10,320 --> 00:53:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's fine.</font></font>

1457
00:53:10,920 --> 00:53:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You actually gave me an opportunity.</font></font>

1458
00:53:13,040 --> 00:53:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After our photo shoot that day,</font></font>

1459
00:53:14,840 --> 00:53:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hadn't spoken to her again.</font></font>

1460
00:53:15,920 --> 00:53:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt I owed her an explanation.</font></font>

1461
00:53:20,480 --> 00:53:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I went to vote earlier,</font></font>

1462
00:53:21,720 --> 00:53:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I asked her about it.</font></font>

1463
00:53:22,480 --> 00:53:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She said she'd been a bit upset.</font></font>

1464
00:53:25,480 --> 00:53:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I picked out an ice cream for her.</font></font>

1465
00:53:28,200 --> 00:53:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A gentleman]
That's nice. Very gentlemanly.</font></font>

1466
00:53:29,440 --> 00:53:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To try and make it up to her.</font></font>

1467
00:53:30,400 --> 00:53:31,280
