1483
00:54:06,280 --> 00:54:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It hurt too much.</font></font>

1484
00:54:08,880 --> 00:54:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But what I mean is,</font></font>

1485
00:54:09,880 --> 00:54:12,800
