1490
00:54:19,160 --> 00:54:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't put it into words.</font></font>

1491
00:54:20,040 --> 00:54:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyway, there were lots of things I didn't do.</font></font>

1492
00:54:22,080 --> 00:54:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I don't think I was much of a gentleman.</font></font>

