<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I actually think...</font></font>

1494
00:54:31,720 --> 00:54:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do I put it?</font></font>

1495
00:54:32,120 --> 00:54:32,800
