1532
00:55:50,680 --> 00:55:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With a personality like mine.</font></font>

1533
00:55:52,840 --> 00:55:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't mean anything else by it.</font></font>

1534
00:55:54,520 --> 00:55:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course. Why couldn't we?</font></font>

1535
00:55:55,320 --> 00:55:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course. Why couldn't we?</font></font>

1536
