<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you've done really well,</font></font>

1791
01:07:03,240 --> 01:07:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">compared with before.</font></font>

1792
01:07:04,280 --> 01:07:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't put it like that.</font></font>

1793
01:07:05,120 --> 01:07:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're not tired, right?</font></font>

1794
01:07:05,920 --> 01:07:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1795
01:07:06,560 --> 01:07:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you talk...</font></font>

1796
01:07:07,360 --> 01:07:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're tired, you don't have to talk.</font></font>

1797
01:07:08,480 --> 01:07:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't talk if you don't feel like it.</font></font>

1798
01:07:10,960 --> 01:07:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When people see</font></font>

1799
01:07:12,480 --> 01:07:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all these cameras following us,</font></font>

1800
01:07:14,680 --> 01:07:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they must think</font></font>

1801
01:07:15,960 --> 01:07:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're filming a web drama.</font></font>

1802
01:07:17,360 --> 01:07:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But once they see the difference between us,</font></font>

1803
01:07:20,440 --> 01:07:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they'll just think I'm here</font></font>

1804
01:07:22,160 --> 01:07:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Bodyguard / Celebrity]
as your personal bodyguard, you know?</font></font>

1805
01:07:24,360 --> 01:07:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like a celebrity who's being filmed,</font></font>

1806
01:07:26,200 --> 01:07:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but still has</font></font>

1807
01:07:27,440 --> 01:07:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a bodyguard beside her.</font></font>

1808
01:07:29,440 --> 01:07:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Pushing him away]
Keep your distance, then.</font></font>

1809
01:07:34,120 --> 01:07:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A friendly tourist]
Are you getting married?</font></font>

1810
01:07:37,320 --> 01:07:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you getting married?</font></font>

1811
01:07:38,680 --> 01:07:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We...</font></font>

1812
01:07:39,600 --> 01:07:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1813
01:07:40,400 --> 01:07:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1814
01:07:41,240 --> 01:07:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A friendly tourist]
We're on a date.</font></font>

1815
01:07:49,160 --> 01:07:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Livening things up]
Having fun shopping with me?</font></font>

1816
01:07:51,760 --> 01:07:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can say yes or no.</font></font>

1817
01:07:53,920 --> 01:07:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really, I don't mind.</font></font>

1818
01:07:56,800 --> 01:07:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong with you?</font></font>

1819
01:07:58,640 --> 01:07:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I can only call you boss?</font></font>

1820
01:08:00,840 --> 01:08:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm never smiling at you again.</font></font>

1821
01:08:01,960 --> 01:08:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said I look like a groundhog.</font></font>

1822
01:08:03,400 --> 01:08:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll just scowl at you from now on.</font></font>

1823
01:08:04,760 --> 01:08:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very cute.</font></font>

1824
01:08:08,080 --> 01:08:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're only eight months older than me.</font></font>

1825
01:08:10,440 --> 01:08:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Eight months.</font></font>

1826
01:08:13,920 --> 01:08:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can do a lot in eight months.</font></font>

1827
01:08:15,320 --> 01:08:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's enough time to stay on the island</font></font>

1828
01:08:16,920 --> 01:08:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sixteen times.</font></font>

1829
01:08:18,040 --> 01:08:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't that long enough?</font></font>

1830
01:08:19,200 --> 01:08:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sixteen seasons.</font></font>

1831
01:08:27,440 --> 01:08:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do we make here?</font></font>

1832
01:08:28,680 --> 01:08:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't you see? Bracelets.</font></font>

1833
01:08:32,280 --> 01:08:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you do this with your ex?</font></font>

1834
01:08:34,480 --> 01:08:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1835
01:08:35,120 --> 01:08:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly, no. I swear.</font></font>

1836
01:08:36,560 --> 01:08:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I swear.</font></font>

1837
01:08:38,120 --> 01:08:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really, no.</font></font>

1838
01:08:39,000 --> 01:08:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who holds up three fingers to swear?</font></font>

1839
01:08:42,440 --> 01:08:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, let's make something.</font></font>

1840
01:08:45,000 --> 01:08:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We should pick a theme together.</font></font>

1841
01:08:46,640 --> 01:08:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think...</font></font>

1842
01:08:48,200 --> 01:08:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A personal suggestion]
Make my face.</font></font>

1843
01:08:49,640 --> 01:08:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Out of shells?</font></font>

1844
01:08:51,080 --> 01:08:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It'll have to be very abstract.</font></font>

1845
01:08:52,880 --> 01:08:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You won't get mad, will you?</font></font>

1846
01:08:54,400 --> 01:08:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1847
01:08:55,120 --> 01:08:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just capture my features, thanks.</font></font>

1848
01:08:58,200 --> 01:08:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right.</font></font>

1849
01:09:02,080 --> 01:09:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of these look very handsome.</font></font>

1850
01:09:03,480 --> 01:09:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to make you a handsome one.</font></font>

1851
01:09:05,400 --> 01:09:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make you a bedside ornament.</font></font>

1852
01:09:07,240 --> 01:09:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A bedside ornament]
How about that?</font></font>

1853
01:09:08,400 --> 01:09:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Promise you'll put it by your bed,</font></font>

1854
01:09:09,880 --> 01:09:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">next to you when you sleep.</font></font>

1855
01:09:12,120 --> 01:09:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1856
01:09:16,960 --> 01:09:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be careful.</font></font>

1857
01:09:19,600 --> 01:09:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait for it to dry a little,</font></font>

1858
01:09:20,880 --> 01:09:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then you can</font></font>

1859
01:09:22,840 --> 01:09:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just scrape it off.</font></font>

1860
01:09:24,000 --> 01:09:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll scrape off the excess.</font></font>

1861
01:09:26,560 --> 01:09:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In your past relationships,</font></font>

1862
01:09:29,080 --> 01:09:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did you ever go on craft dates?</font></font>

1863
01:09:33,480 --> 01:09:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't really</font></font>

1864
01:09:34,440 --> 01:09:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">suggest doing this myself.</font></font>

1865
01:09:35,920 --> 01:09:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if the girl wanted to,</font></font>

1866
01:09:37,440 --> 01:09:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd happily go with her.</font></font>

1867
01:09:42,040 --> 01:09:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's your ex's personality like?</font></font>

1868
01:09:45,560 --> 01:09:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's just</font></font>

1869
01:09:48,560 --> 01:09:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a regular guy,</font></font>

1870
01:09:51,920 --> 01:09:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">personality-wise.</font></font>

1871
01:09:53,880 --> 01:09:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not especially outgoing,</font></font>

1872
01:09:55,360 --> 01:09:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but not too quiet either.</font></font>

1873
01:09:57,280 --> 01:09:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's pretty funny around his friends.</font></font>

1874
01:10:01,440 --> 01:10:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sounds a bit like me.</font></font>

1875
01:10:02,640 --> 01:10:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A bit like me]</font></font>

1876
01:10:03,520 --> 01:10:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not being full of myself.</font></font>

1877
01:10:04,520 --> 01:10:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm just saying...</font></font>

1878
01:10:05,800 --> 01:10:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, he's different from you.</font></font>

1879
01:10:08,240 --> 01:10:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't really know how to explain it.</font></font>

1880
01:10:09,240 --> 01:10:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We met so young,</font></font>

1881
01:10:10,840 --> 01:10:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I don't know</font></font>

1882
01:10:11,560 --> 01:10:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how other people see him.</font></font>

1883
01:10:13,960 --> 01:10:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like, when they meet him,</font></font>

1884
01:10:15,000 --> 01:10:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what they think his personality is like.</font></font>

1885
01:10:17,120 --> 01:10:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I get it.</font></font>

1886
01:10:18,000 --> 01:10:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you know someone so well,</font></font>

1887
01:10:18,800 --> 01:10:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's hard to say</font></font>

1888
01:10:19,680 --> 01:10:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what really stands out about them.</font></font>

1889
01:10:21,080 --> 01:10:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1890
01:10:25,320 --> 01:10:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you ask Gao Yuheng on a date that day?</font></font>

1891
01:10:26,720 --> 01:10:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Why ask Gao Yuheng on a date?]</font></font>

1892
01:10:27,720 --> 01:10:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

1893
01:10:28,080 --> 01:10:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you go on a date with Gao Yuheng?</font></font>

1894
01:10:30,520 --> 01:10:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I feel</font></font>

1895
01:10:31,040 --> 01:10:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">no pressure when I talk to him.</font></font>

1896
01:10:37,120 --> 01:10:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With him, it's just...</font></font>

1897
01:10:38,600 --> 01:10:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just having a meal.</font></font>

1898
01:10:42,480 --> 01:10:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[What about me?]
Why didn't you eat with me?</font></font>

1899
01:10:46,000 --> 01:10:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I've asked you so many times.</font></font>

1900
01:10:47,320 --> 01:10:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why does it always have to be me?</font></font>

1901
01:10:59,120 --> 01:11:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Early to bed, early to rise. Keep getting better.</font></font>

1902
01:11:00,640 --> 01:11:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's so ugly.</font></font>

1903
01:11:02,280 --> 01:11:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wang Sheng's self-portrait]</font></font>

1904
01:11:05,040 --> 01:11:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's this?</font></font>

1905
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Can't bear to look]</font></font>

1906
01:11:12,520 --> 01:11:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This soccer ball is my eyes.</font></font>

1907
01:11:14,520 --> 01:11:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wang Sheng's eyes]</font></font>

1908
01:11:17,480 --> 01:11:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You look...</font></font>

1909
01:11:18,560 --> 01:11:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's terrifying.</font></font>

1910
01:11:19,920 --> 01:11:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't you say I have monolids?</font></font>

1911
01:11:21,480 --> 01:11:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So the eyes are tiny,</font></font>

1912
01:11:22,400 --> 01:11:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the grin is huge.</font></font>

1913
01:11:24,400 --> 01:11:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't you say my smile was cute?</font></font>

1914
01:11:26,240 --> 01:11:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And two horns.</font></font>

1915
01:11:28,520 --> 01:11:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Early to bed, early to rise. Keep getting better.</font></font>

1916
01:11:30,680 --> 01:11:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you looked like that,</font></font>

1917
01:11:31,560 --> 01:11:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on the first day,</font></font>

1918
01:11:32,160 --> 01:11:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I probably wouldn't have asked you out.</font></font>

1919
01:11:34,400 --> 01:11:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Excitedly slaps the table]</font></font>

1920
01:11:35,000 --> 01:11:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You think I'm handsome?</font></font>

1921
01:11:38,600 --> 01:11:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you're pretty handsome. So what?</font></font>

1922
01:11:44,720 --> 01:11:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right.</font></font>

1923
01:11:45,120 --> 01:11:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You kept calling other guys handsome before.</font></font>

1924
01:11:51,520 --> 01:11:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It even lights up.</font></font>

1925
01:11:54,960 --> 01:11:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even more handsome.</font></font>

1926
01:11:57,520 --> 01:11:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help.</font></font>

1927
01:12:01,200 --> 01:12:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ren Chunxi's version of Wang Sheng]
Yours is pretty cute.</font></font>

1928
01:12:02,360 --> 01:12:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Obviously.</font></font>

1929
01:12:03,040 --> 01:12:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because it's me.</font></font>

1930
01:12:04,240 --> 01:12:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This one's me too.</font></font>

1931
01:12:05,000 --> 01:12:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two sides of me.</font></font>

1932
01:12:07,120 --> 01:12:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Handsome Wang Sheng]
This one's "Handsome Wang Sheng."</font></font>

1933
01:12:08,520 --> 01:12:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ugly Wang Sheng]
This one's "Ugly Wang Sheng."</font></font>

1934
01:12:11,200 --> 01:12:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And why are you</font></font>

1935
01:12:13,200 --> 01:12:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">crouching like that?</font></font>

1936
01:12:14,360 --> 01:12:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you crouching or lying down?</font></font>

1937
01:12:16,360 --> 01:12:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I need to prop my face up,</font></font>

1938
01:12:17,960 --> 01:12:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I'm looking at you.</font></font>

1939
01:12:20,400 --> 01:12:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I can look right at you.</font></font>

1940
01:12:21,960 --> 01:12:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise, the girl in the next bed would see too.</font></font>

1941
01:12:24,880 --> 01:12:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then it wouldn't be special.</font></font>

1942
01:12:27,800 --> 01:12:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Exclusively for Ren Chunxi]</font></font>

1943
01:12:29,480 --> 01:12:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">An exclusive gift, okay?</font></font>

1944
01:12:31,520 --> 01:12:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's take a photo together.</font></font>

1945
01:12:35,320 --> 01:12:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Coming back to the real world for a while</font></font>

1946
01:12:37,320 --> 01:12:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">helped me get to know him better.</font></font>

1947
01:12:39,480 --> 01:12:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He went from being two-dimensional</font></font>

1948
01:12:40,920 --> 01:12:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to a real, three-dimensional person.</font></font>

1949
01:12:45,000 --> 01:12:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll show you a good time today.</font></font>

1950
01:12:46,680 --> 01:12:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you from Dalian? How will you show me around?</font></font>

1951
01:12:49,160 --> 01:12:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know how to have fun.</font></font>

1952
01:12:50,080 --> 01:12:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Guaranteed]</font></font>

1953
01:12:51,400 --> 01:12:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't you tell?</font></font>

1954
01:12:54,680 --> 01:12:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're boring.</font></font>

1955
01:12:56,600 --> 01:12:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[You're a bit boring]</font></font>

1956
01:12:57,560 --> 01:12:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do I seem like a boring person,</font></font>

1957
01:12:59,200 --> 01:13:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or what?</font></font>

1958
01:13:00,200 --> 01:13:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes.</font></font>

1959
01:13:01,160 --> 01:13:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought you were pretty funny on day one.</font></font>

1960
01:13:03,560 --> 01:13:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But later,</font></font>

1961
01:13:04,960 --> 01:13:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt like you</font></font>

1962
01:13:06,880 --> 01:13:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">suddenly became a bit subdued.</font></font>

1963
01:13:09,520 --> 01:13:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because being subdued looks cooler.</font></font>

1964
01:13:10,880 --> 01:13:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A quietly handsome guy]</font></font>

1965
01:13:12,560 --> 01:13:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

1966
01:13:14,040 --> 01:13:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Being loud all the time gets annoying, right?</font></font>

1967
01:13:16,080 --> 01:13:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not really.</font></font>

1968
01:13:16,960 --> 01:13:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes I wondered</font></font>

1969
01:13:18,800 --> 01:13:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if something had upset you.</font></font>

1970
01:13:21,000 --> 01:13:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought, this guy's usually so lively.</font></font>

1971
01:13:23,240 --> 01:13:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why has he suddenly...</font></font>

1972
01:13:23,840 --> 01:13:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She noticed Gao was unhappy]</font></font>

1973
01:13:24,800 --> 01:13:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seemed unhappy, right?</font></font>

1974
01:13:25,640 --> 01:13:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1975
01:13:26,120 --> 01:13:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you noticed.</font></font>

1976
01:13:27,080 --> 01:13:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought nobody could tell.</font></font>

1977
01:13:30,360 --> 01:13:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I could tell.</font></font>

1978
01:13:33,080 --> 01:13:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not that I was unhappy.</font></font>

1979
01:13:33,680 --> 01:13:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe my energy had just run out.</font></font>

1980
01:13:37,640 --> 01:13:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just...</font></font>

1981
01:13:38,720 --> 01:13:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was so lively on day one</font></font>

1982
01:13:40,040 --> 01:13:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because I hate awkward silences.</font></font>

1983
01:13:42,400 --> 01:13:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like everyone to be happy</font></font>

1984
01:13:44,240 --> 01:13:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and full of energy.</font></font>

1985
01:13:45,560 --> 01:13:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But once I feel</font></font>

1986
01:13:46,000 --> 01:13:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everyone's having fun,</font></font>

1987
01:13:46,960 --> 01:13:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think...</font></font>

1988
01:13:47,600 --> 01:13:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can dial it back.</font></font>

1989
01:13:48,440 --> 01:13:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't need to keep doing that.</font></font>

1990
01:13:50,520 --> 01:13:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's actually pretty tiring.</font></font>

1991
01:13:52,640 --> 01:13:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to worry about silence today,</font></font>

1992
01:13:54,640 --> 01:13:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or force yourself to say anything.</font></font>

1993
01:13:55,680 --> 01:13:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not afraid of silence.</font></font>

1994
01:13:57,000 --> 01:13:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've actually gotten used to it.</font></font>

1995
01:13:58,840 --> 01:14:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as we're comfortable, that's enough.</font></font>

1996
01:14:00,360 --> 01:14:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

1997
01:14:00,800 --> 01:14:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Comfort comes first]</font></font>

1998
01:14:02,680 --> 01:14:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Explaining yesterday's mood]
I was actually upset yesterday.</font></font>

1999
01:14:04,200 --> 01:14:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can tell you why.</font></font>

2000
01:14:05,520 --> 01:14:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I noticed you were upset that evening too.</font></font>

2001
01:14:13,920 --> 01:14:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My show-off energy's run out a bit.</font></font>

2002
01:14:15,360 --> 01:14:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take a break.</font></font>

2003
01:14:16,400 --> 01:14:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take a break.</font></font>

2004
01:14:17,760 --> 01:14:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know why yesterday</font></font>

2005
01:14:18,880 --> 01:14:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt so low.</font></font>

2006
01:14:19,400 --> 01:14:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">First of all, I thought,</font></font>

2007
01:14:20,200 --> 01:14:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why is time flying by?</font></font>

2008
01:14:21,760 --> 01:14:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The afternoon was so much fun.</font></font>

2009
01:14:22,840 --> 01:14:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was bursting with happiness.</font></font>

2010
01:14:26,680 --> 01:14:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It felt like a once-in-a-lifetime</font></font>

2011
01:14:28,520 --> 01:14:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">kind of moment.</font></font>

2012
01:14:30,600 --> 01:14:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And time seemed to fly by.</font></font>

2013
01:14:32,720 --> 01:14:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And secondly,</font></font>

2014
01:14:36,640 --> 01:14:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well...</font></font>

2015
01:14:38,240 --> 01:14:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want to be "the show-off" anymore.</font></font>

2016
01:14:40,320 --> 01:14:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A helpless show-off]</font></font>

2017
01:14:41,360 --> 01:14:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

2018
01:14:42,480 --> 01:14:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe everyone</font></font>

2019
01:14:44,240 --> 01:14:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has a different idea of what that means.</font></font>

2020
01:14:46,360 --> 01:14:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To me, "show-off" is...</font></font>

2021
01:14:47,960 --> 01:14:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">More negative, right?</font></font>

2022
01:14:48,960 --> 01:14:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A bit more negative, yes.</font></font>

2023
01:14:50,400 --> 01:14:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe it's because before,</font></font>

2024
01:14:53,240 --> 01:14:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when I was on social media,</font></font>

2025
01:14:54,280 --> 01:14:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">people called me things like that.</font></font>

2026
01:14:57,720 --> 01:14:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I seemed unbothered on the outside,</font></font>

2027
01:14:59,520 --> 01:15:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but deep down, that word</font></font>

2028
01:15:01,280 --> 01:15:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">made me uncomfortable.</font></font>

2029
01:15:02,800 --> 01:15:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It shouldn't be used to describe me.</font></font>

2030
01:15:04,040 --> 01:15:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I make fun of myself</font></font>

2031
01:15:06,760 --> 01:15:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to liven things up, or...</font></font>

2032
01:15:10,320 --> 01:15:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Or...</font></font>

2033
01:15:11,560 --> 01:15:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not what you mean by it.</font></font>

2034
01:15:13,560 --> 01:15:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not actually trying to show off.</font></font>

2035
01:15:16,680 --> 01:15:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just want everyone to be happy,</font></font>

2036
01:15:18,360 --> 01:15:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to lighten the mood.</font></font>

2037
01:15:18,920 --> 01:15:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But to me, a show-off</font></font>

2038
01:15:21,160 --> 01:15:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is someone deliberately</font></font>

2039
01:15:21,920 --> 01:15:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">trying to look impressive.</font></font>

2040
01:15:23,200 --> 01:15:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I'm not pretending, right?</font></font>

2041
01:15:24,720 --> 01:15:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah. You're great.</font></font>

2042
01:15:25,880 --> 01:15:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you weren't like this,</font></font>

2043
01:15:27,520 --> 01:15:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't have voted for you.</font></font>

2044
01:15:29,520 --> 01:15:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I felt a little hurt.</font></font>

2045
01:15:30,680 --> 01:15:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wondered,</font></font>

2046
01:15:32,320 --> 01:15:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did I make the wrong first impression?</font></font>

2047
01:15:35,120 --> 01:15:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No. Listen,</font></font>

2048
01:15:36,200 --> 01:15:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a personality like yours</font></font>

2049
01:15:38,320 --> 01:15:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will always have people</font></font>

2050
01:15:40,840 --> 01:15:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who appreciate it.</font></font>

2051
01:15:42,120 --> 01:15:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

2052
01:15:42,760 --> 01:15:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe not everyone likes it.</font></font>

2053
01:15:44,040 --> 01:15:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yesterday, maybe...</font></font>

2054
01:15:46,440 --> 01:15:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It felt like nobody really liked it,</font></font>

2055
01:15:48,000 --> 01:15:49,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I was a little hurt.</font></font>

2056
01:15:49,520 --> 01:15:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">During Truth Night.</font></font>

2057
01:15:51,600 --> 01:15:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really like people like you.</font></font>

2058
01:15:53,120 --> 01:15:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Most of the people</font></font>

2059
01:15:55,200 --> 01:15:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm closest to</font></font>

2060
01:15:56,360 --> 01:15:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have that kind of personality.</font></font>

2061
01:15:57,560 --> 01:15:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Great. Let's all hang out sometime.</font></font>

2062
01:15:59,320 --> 01:15:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

2063
01:15:59,960 --> 01:16:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll show you a good time.</font></font>

2064
01:16:00,960 --> 01:16:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

2065
01:16:01,240 --> 01:16:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once this show is over.</font></font>

2066
01:16:03,280 --> 01:16:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We always have so much fun.</font></font>

2067
01:16:04,240 --> 01:16:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone should just be themselves.</font></font>

2068
01:16:06,200 --> 01:16:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We don't hang out with people who put on an act.</font></font>

2069
01:16:08,400 --> 01:16:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I need someone cheerful like that</font></font>

2070
01:16:11,240 --> 01:16:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to bring me out of my shell.</font></font>

2071
01:16:12,040 --> 01:16:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And once I open up,</font></font>

2072
01:16:14,720 --> 01:16:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm so loud.</font></font>

2073
01:16:16,480 --> 01:16:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Way too loud.</font></font>

2074
01:16:17,960 --> 01:16:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

2075
01:16:18,320 --> 01:16:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're the only loud one,</font></font>

2076
01:16:20,640 --> 01:16:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it feels awkward.</font></font>

2077
01:16:21,480 --> 01:16:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if everyone's loud, you're on the same wavelength.</font></font>

2078
01:16:23,280 --> 01:16:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I love being on the same wavelength.</font></font>

2079
01:16:25,240 --> 01:16:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why I lean toward outgoing people.</font></font>

2080
01:16:27,240 --> 01:16:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They lift my energy,</font></font>

2081
01:16:29,080 --> 01:16:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and bring out...</font></font>

2082
01:16:30,840 --> 01:16:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bring out your hidden personality.</font></font>

2083
01:16:32,880 --> 01:16:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Bringing out her lively side]
Right.</font></font>

2084
01:16:35,040 --> 01:16:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I see what you mean.</font></font>

2085
01:16:36,760 --> 01:16:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got such a great personality.</font></font>

2086
01:16:38,560 --> 01:16:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So cheerful.</font></font>

2087
01:16:41,200 --> 01:16:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And you're pretty too.</font></font>

2088
01:16:42,560 --> 01:16:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can stop with the "pretty" part.</font></font>

2089
01:16:44,520 --> 01:16:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Adorable]
I'm just cute, that's all.</font></font>

2090
01:16:46,360 --> 01:16:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I really mean it.</font></font>

2091
01:16:47,640 --> 01:16:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I'm someone</font></font>

2092
01:16:50,360 --> 01:16:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who really cares about looks, you know?</font></font>

2093
01:16:52,240 --> 01:16:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I first arrived, looks-wise,</font></font>

2094
01:16:55,080 --> 01:16:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yuning, Shihan, and you were...</font></font>

2095
01:16:57,400 --> 01:16:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told them right away,</font></font>

2096
01:16:58,960 --> 01:17:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there were three people I was interested in.</font></font>

2097
01:17:01,000 --> 01:17:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No way.</font></font>

2098
01:17:02,000 --> 01:17:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You definitely thought Yuning and Shihan were pretty.</font></font>

2099
01:17:05,400 --> 01:17:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know why?</font></font>

2100
01:17:06,600 --> 01:17:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Super sensitive]
Let me tell you how sensitive I am.</font></font>

2101
01:17:08,800 --> 01:17:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you thought I was pretty too,</font></font>

2102
01:17:10,360 --> 01:17:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you would've picked me at least once these past few days,</font></font>

2103
01:17:13,160 --> 01:17:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or given me a Moonstone or something.</font></font>

2104
01:17:15,400 --> 01:17:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you know I gave them Moonstones?</font></font>

2105
01:17:16,760 --> 01:17:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not just Moonstones. Picking someone too.</font></font>

2106
01:17:18,040 --> 01:17:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even just picking me.</font></font>

2107
01:17:19,960 --> 01:17:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't pick Yuning either.</font></font>

2108
01:17:21,960 --> 01:17:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A tiny tantrum]
No, you didn't pick me.</font></font>

2109
01:17:24,680 --> 01:17:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You only picked Yuning and Shihan.</font></font>

2110
01:17:26,800 --> 01:17:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to say that</font></font>

2111
01:17:27,360 --> 01:17:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just because</font></font>

2112
01:17:28,520 --> 01:17:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're on a date.</font></font>

2113
01:17:29,280 --> 01:17:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I really mean it.</font></font>

2114
01:17:30,040 --> 01:17:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can watch it back later.</font></font>

2115
01:17:31,720 --> 01:17:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seriously?</font></font>

2116
01:17:32,400 --> 01:17:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really.</font></font>

