01:30:40,680 --> 01:30:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because Xixi is outgoing.</font></font>

2444
01:30:45,600 --> 01:30:46,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only seven days left.</font></font>

2445
01:30:46,840 --> 01:30:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why? It's gone so fast.</font></font>

2446
01:30:49,440 --> 01:30:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seven days.</font></font>

2447
01:30:50,600 --> 01:30:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not fast. Seven days is ages.</font></font>

2448
01:30:53,280 --> 01:30:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The wheat back home is ripe.</font></font>

2449
01:30:54,360 --> 01:30:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The wheat back home is ripe]</font></font>

2450
01:30:55,040 --> 01:30:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Know what that means?</font></font>

2451
01:30:56,040 --> 01:30:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

2452
01:30:57,720 --> 01:30:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you seen X-Change?</font></font>

2453
01:30:58,760 --> 01:30:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

2454
01:30:59,920 --> 01:31:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you know that meme?</font></font>

2455
01:31:00,760 --> 01:31:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

2456
01:31:02,520 --> 01:31:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What is it?</font></font>

2457
01:31:04,520 --> 01:31:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It means you have to leave this utopia</font></font>

2458
01:31:06,400 --> 01:31:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and go back to your real life.</font></font>

2459
01:31:15,320 --> 01:31:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really miss Qian Shihan.</font></font>

2460
01:31:17,280 --> 01:31:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I miss everyone too.</font></font>

2461
01:31:18,760 --> 01:31:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really want to talk to Qian Shihan.</font></font>

2462
01:31:20,120 --> 01:31:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even though I know</font></font>

2463
01:31:20,600 --> 01:31:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I might not have the courage,</font></font>

2464
01:31:22,080 --> 01:31:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still</font></font>

2465
01:31:23,640 --> 01:31:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wonder what it'd be like</font></font>

2466
01:31:26,080 --> 01:31:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if I were on the island.</font></font>

2467
01:31:26,880 --> 01:31:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I keep thinking,</font></font>

2468
01:31:28,400 --> 01:31:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why is time going so fast?</font></font>

2469
01:31:29,800 --> 01:31:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can feel how different we are.</font></font>

2470
01:31:32,800 --> 01:31:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't think we have much of a future.</font></font>

2471
01:31:35,440 --> 01:31:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I feel</font></font>

2472
01:31:38,880 --> 01:31:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Make the most of this time]
I should treasure the time we have.</font></font>

2473
01:31:45,120 --> 01:31:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly,</font></font>

2474
01:31:46,680 --> 01:31:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's been a very, very long time</font></font>

2475
01:31:48,040 --> 01:31:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">since I spent time with a girl like this.</font></font>

2476
01:31:50,960 --> 01:31:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

2477
01:31:52,440 --> 01:31:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Taking time to get to know someone]
Slowly getting to know someone.</font></font>

2478
01:31:55,760 --> 01:31:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then do you usually...?</font></font>

2479
01:31:56,880 --> 01:31:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Through social media.</font></font>

2480
01:31:59,480 --> 01:32:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

2481
01:32:00,320 --> 01:32:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

2482
01:32:00,440 --> 01:32:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Before you've even met her in person, you...?</font></font>

2483
01:32:02,000 --> 01:32:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I mean,</font></font>

2484
01:32:03,520 --> 01:32:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I get to know her online first,</font></font>

2485
01:32:04,920 --> 01:32:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then we meet in real life.</font></font>

2486
01:32:11,200 --> 01:32:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe</font></font>

2487
01:32:12,800 --> 01:32:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">most of my relationships</font></font>

2488
01:32:14,840 --> 01:32:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have been pretty casual and short-lived.</font></font>

2489
01:32:18,160 --> 01:32:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think a serious relationship</font></font>

2490
01:32:21,680 --> 01:32:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">takes a lot out of you.</font></font>

2491
01:32:23,000 --> 01:32:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If she's not</font></font>

2492
01:32:24,080 --> 01:32:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that invested in the relationship,</font></font>

2493
01:32:25,240 --> 01:32:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and neither are you,</font></font>

2494
01:32:26,000 --> 01:32:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you're just enjoying the experience,</font></font>

2495
01:32:27,840 --> 01:32:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can be really happy.</font></font>

2496
01:32:28,880 --> 01:32:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to worry about</font></font>

2497
01:32:31,720 --> 01:32:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your future together.</font></font>

2498
01:32:33,160 --> 01:32:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And you don't have to</font></font>

2499
01:32:34,920 --> 01:32:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">show her every part of yourself,</font></font>

2500
01:32:35,880 --> 01:32:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">even the bad sides, right?</font></font>

2501
01:32:37,720 --> 01:32:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But in a really serious relationship</font></font>

2502
01:32:39,640 --> 01:32:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with a future,</font></font>

2503
01:32:40,440 --> 01:32:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you might</font></font>

2504
01:32:42,840 --> 01:32:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have to show her</font></font>

2505
01:32:44,360 --> 01:32:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the parts of yourself</font></font>

2506
01:32:46,440 --> 01:32:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that make you feel insecure.</font></font>

2507
01:32:47,880 --> 01:32:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For me,</font></font>

2508
01:32:49,880 --> 01:32:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's a huge challenge.</font></font>

2509
01:32:52,480 --> 01:32:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know if you're the same.</font></font>

2510
01:32:54,360 --> 01:32:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So are you still only having</font></font>

2511
01:32:56,240 --> 01:32:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">casual relationships?</font></font>

2512
01:32:57,200 --> 01:32:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you never thought</font></font>

2513
01:32:59,280 --> 01:33:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about changing that?</font></font>

2514
01:33:01,840 --> 01:33:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

2515
01:33:02,240 --> 01:33:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want a real relationship.</font></font>

2516
01:33:04,720 --> 01:33:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why I came here.</font></font>

2517
01:33:07,320 --> 01:33:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Before coming to the Island of Affection,</font></font>

2518
01:33:08,480 --> 01:33:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought a lot about my motto.</font></font>

2519
01:33:09,880 --> 01:33:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And there's one line:</font></font>

2520
01:33:11,840 --> 01:33:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Logic says I should love myself more.</font></font>

2521
01:33:15,160 --> 01:33:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I want to leave logic behind."</font></font>

2522
01:33:16,280 --> 01:33:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's what I truly want.</font></font>

2523
01:33:18,160 --> 01:33:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I love myself more than her,</font></font>

2524
01:33:21,560 --> 01:33:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can handle whatever she does.</font></font>

2525
01:33:24,760 --> 01:33:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if she takes up more of my life</font></font>

2526
01:33:27,120 --> 01:33:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">than I do,</font></font>

2527
01:33:28,640 --> 01:33:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll gradually</font></font>

2528
01:33:30,200 --> 01:33:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">reshape my life around hers.</font></font>

2529
01:33:32,240 --> 01:33:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If she leaves me then,</font></font>

2530
01:33:35,080 --> 01:33:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be completely broken.</font></font>

2531
01:33:37,120 --> 01:33:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Has that happened to you?</font></font>

2532
01:33:39,080 --> 01:33:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once before.</font></font>

2533
01:33:40,360 --> 01:33:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you've already been broken.</font></font>

2534
01:33:42,280 --> 01:33:43,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just a little broken, once.</font></font>

2535
01:33:45,960 --> 01:33:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you want to change yourself,</font></font>

2536
01:33:46,960 --> 01:33:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or do you want to try</font></font>

2537
01:33:48,600 --> 01:33:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a relationship that isn't casual?</font></font>

2538
01:33:49,920 --> 01:33:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just don't want another casual relationship.</font></font>

2539
01:33:52,040 --> 01:33:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right, then...</font></font>

2540
01:33:53,480 --> 01:33:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have a real relationship.</font></font>

2541
01:33:54,200 --> 01:33:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give it a serious try again.</font></font>

2542
01:33:56,760 --> 01:33:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, take it slowly.</font></font>

2543
01:33:58,520 --> 01:34:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't overthink it.</font></font>

2544
01:34:00,760 --> 01:34:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

2545
01:34:01,560 --> 01:34:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My view on relationships</font></font>

2546
01:34:03,480 --> 01:34:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is that everyone</font></font>

2547
01:34:04,320 --> 01:34:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">needs a life of their own.</font></font>

2548
01:34:06,080 --> 01:34:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

2549
01:34:06,800 --> 01:34:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get your own life in order first,</font></font>

2550
01:34:08,680 --> 01:34:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then you're ready to love someone else.</font></font>

2551
01:34:10,880 --> 01:34:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then you have the capacity to love.</font></font>

2552
01:34:12,000 --> 01:34:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

2553
01:34:12,840 --> 01:34:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly. I think so too.</font></font>

2554
01:34:13,840 --> 01:34:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's exactly how I feel.</font></font>

2555
01:34:17,520 --> 01:34:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's take a picture of this.</font></font>

2556
01:34:19,560 --> 01:34:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The sun's setting.</font></font>

2557
01:34:21,120 --> 01:34:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's about to go down.</font></font>

2558
01:34:21,880 --> 01:34:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We might catch the sunset from the boat.</font></font>

2559
01:34:25,000 --> 01:34:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Another sunset. I'm so happy.</font></font>

2560
01:34:32,760 --> 01:34:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you prefer</font></font>

2561
01:34:34,120 --> 01:34:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">someone more outgoing, right?</font></font>

2562
01:34:37,600 --> 01:34:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

2563
01:34:38,720 --> 01:34:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

2564
01:34:42,360 --> 01:34:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A lot of people like someone</font></font>

2565
01:34:43,400 --> 01:34:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who's different from them,</font></font>

2566
01:34:45,240 --> 01:34:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">right?</font></font>

2567
01:34:45,640 --> 01:34:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

2568
01:34:46,360 --> 01:34:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Someone who complements them.</font></font>

2569
01:34:48,800 --> 01:34:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm so happy.</font></font>

2570
01:34:49,680 --> 01:34:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My dream girl picked me on day one.</font></font>

2571
01:34:50,960 --> 01:34:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm so happy.</font></font>

2572
01:34:51,600 --> 01:34:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Over the moon]</font></font>

2573
01:34:52,800 --> 01:34:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know why,</font></font>

2574
01:34:54,160 --> 01:34:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I got to go on a date with you. Amazing.</font></font>

2575
01:34:57,640 --> 01:35:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course, if you really like me,</font></font>

2576
01:35:00,040 --> 01:35:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll let myself get away with anything.</font></font>

2577
01:35:01,920 --> 01:35:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I'll really get away with anything.</font></font>

2578
01:35:03,080 --> 01:35:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're nuts.</font></font>

2579
01:35:06,480 --> 01:35:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's that called? Getting too comfortable?</font></font>

2580
01:35:10,160 --> 01:35:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Affection.</font></font>

2581
01:35:13,920 --> 01:35:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How exactly did you describe your ideal type to them?</font></font>

2582
01:35:17,120 --> 01:35:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You want to hear how I praised you?</font></font>

2583
01:35:18,800 --> 01:35:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Want to hear how I praised you?]</font></font>

2584
01:35:21,880 --> 01:35:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like someone with striking, elegant looks,</font></font>

2585
01:35:25,120 --> 01:35:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and on the taller side.</font></font>

2586
01:35:27,880 --> 01:35:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think we'd look good together.</font></font>

2587
01:35:28,840 --> 01:35:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A sunny, cheerful personality.</font></font>

2588
01:35:31,320 --> 01:35:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Although you're not really...</font></font>

2589
01:35:33,480 --> 01:35:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're not exactly radiant sunshine,</font></font>

2590
01:35:35,600 --> 01:35:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you have warmth.</font></font>

2591
01:35:37,360 --> 01:35:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I'm gloomy sunshine?</font></font>

2592
01:35:39,360 --> 01:35:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, you're warm, but...</font></font>

2593
01:35:42,440 --> 01:35:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fierce sunshine.</font></font>

2594
01:35:44,200 --> 01:35:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do I put it?</font></font>

2595
01:36:12,920 --> 01:36:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Secretly filming Ren Chunxi asleep]</font></font>

2596
01:36:23,360 --> 01:36:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on, let's head toward the sunset.</font></font>

2597
01:36:25,840 --> 01:36:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

2598
01:36:31,360 --> 01:36:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did I really paddle that far?</font></font>

2599
01:36:33,120 --> 01:36:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look, you really did.</font></font>

2600
01:36:35,400 --> 01:36:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Amazing.</font></font>

2601
01:36:36,880 --> 01:36:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lie down.</font></font>

2602
01:36:37,400 --> 01:36:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm scared.</font></font>

2603
01:36:38,440 --> 01:36:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Trust me.</font></font>

2604
01:36:39,480 --> 01:36:40,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's really comfortable lying here.</font></font>

2605
01:36:43,280 --> 01:36:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How is it?</font></font>

2606
01:36:44,000 --> 01:36:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So pretty.</font></font>

2607
01:36:49,520 --> 01:36:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So beautiful.</font></font>

2608
01:36:50,920 --> 01:36:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The sky is so beautiful.</font></font>

2609
01:36:54,960 --> 01:36:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You picked the right person, didn't you?</font></font>

2610
01:36:55,960 --> 01:36:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I picked the right person.</font></font>

2611
01:36:57,360 --> 01:36:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were my first choice.</font></font>

2612
01:36:58,480 --> 01:37:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to choose you.</font></font>

2613
01:37:04,800 --> 01:37:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So awkward, so boring. I don't know what to do.</font></font>

2614
01:37:08,400 --> 01:37:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why is it like this?</font></font>

2615
01:37:09,720 --> 01:37:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is it because Gao isn't here?</font></font>

2616
01:37:10,960 --> 01:37:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Could it be?</font></font>

2617
01:37:11,680 --> 01:37:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're missing our show-off.</font></font>

2618
01:37:13,440 --> 01:37:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Without Gao,</font></font>

2619
01:37:14,520 --> 01:37:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the island's a bit boring.</font></font>

2620
01:37:16,240 --> 01:37:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It'd feel more relaxed if he were here.</font></font>

2621
01:37:19,160 --> 01:37:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We really need him to liven things up.</font></font>

2622
01:37:22,640 --> 01:37:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is so beautiful.</font></font>

2623
01:37:24,000 --> 01:37:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From here, it's absolutely gorgeous.</font></font>

2624
01:37:25,520 --> 01:37:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is nice. Feels like a vacation.</font></font>

2625
01:37:28,200 --> 01:37:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's really, really relaxing.</font></font>

2626
01:37:29,040 --> 01:37:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This moment makes it all worth it.</font></font>

2627
01:37:31,200 --> 01:37:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This moment makes the past few days worth it.</font></font>

2628
01:37:34,480 --> 01:37:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A gentle breeze.</font></font>

2629
01:37:36,280 --> 01:37:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This feels amazing.</font></font>

2630
01:37:48,040 --> 01:37:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[On or off the island, the same gentle sky embraces us all]</font></font>

2631
01:37:59,840 --> 01:38:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've actually been worrying</font></font>

2632
01:38:01,360 --> 01:38:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about what he really means.</font></font>

2633
01:38:03,200 --> 01:38:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wondering what Zheng Shoudong really means]</font></font>

2634
01:38:04,640 --> 01:38:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, before this,</font></font>

2635
01:38:05,600 --> 01:38:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought you two were serious too.</font></font>

2636
01:38:07,480 --> 01:38:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was serious.</font></font>

2637
01:38:09,560 --> 01:38:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if he feels that way,</font></font>

2638
01:38:11,360 --> 01:38:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then that's that.</font></font>

2639
01:38:13,160 --> 01:38:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This isn't something</font></font>

2640
01:38:14,160 --> 01:38:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">one person can make happen alone.</font></font>

2641
01:38:16,880 --> 01:38:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you noticed that all day</font></font>

2642
01:38:18,200 --> 01:38:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've avoided being alone with him?</font></font>

2643
01:38:21,120 --> 01:38:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's been more than a day.</font></font>

2644
01:38:22,960 --> 01:38:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

2645
01:38:24,560 --> 01:38:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He said he wanted us to be friends,</font></font>

2646
01:38:26,760 --> 01:38:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to keep getting along that way,</font></font>

2647
01:38:27,720 --> 01:38:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and enjoy our own time on the island.</font></font>

2648
01:38:28,840 --> 01:38:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I thought,</font></font>

2649
01:38:29,680 --> 01:38:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">let's keep some boundaries as friends.</font></font>

2650
01:38:31,640 --> 01:38:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, that's fair enough.</font></font>

2651
01:38:33,040 --> 01:38:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right. I took your advice,</font></font>

2652
01:38:35,480 --> 01:38:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I acted on it.</font></font>

2653
01:38:40,680 --> 01:38:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you figured it out?</font></font>

2654
01:38:42,520 --> 01:38:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't explain it. I don't know.</font></font>

2655
01:38:47,360 --> 01:38:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you still want to get to know her, right?</font></font>

2656
01:38:51,880 --> 01:38:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

2657
01:38:53,160 --> 01:38:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When we hang out,</font></font>

2658
01:38:54,160 --> 01:38:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still have a great time.</font></font>

2659
01:38:55,240 --> 01:38:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's your type?</font></font>

2660
01:38:56,520 --> 01:38:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did she win you over?</font></font>

2661
01:38:57,600 --> 01:38:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Why did Hu Ke'er win you over?]</font></font>

2662
01:38:59,360 --> 01:39:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[It's all about that initial spark]
I really go by that initial spark.</font></font>

2663
01:39:02,360 --> 01:39:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Getting close to her</font></font>

2664
01:39:05,440 --> 01:39:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">felt like fate.</font></font>

2665
01:39:06,520 --> 01:39:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like when we first went to open those locks,</font></font>

2666
01:39:09,000 --> 01:39:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the first one I picked up was Hu Ke'er's.</font></font>

2667
01:39:10,680 --> 01:39:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And she happened to be right beside me.</font></font>

2668
01:39:11,960 --> 01:39:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then we teamed up later.</font></font>

2669
01:39:13,880 --> 01:39:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's really about the feeling.</font></font>

2670
01:39:15,120 --> 01:39:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you ask me why,</font></font>

2671
01:39:15,920 --> 01:39:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't come up with an answer.</font></font>

2672
01:39:17,800 --> 01:39:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We get along well,</font></font>

2673
01:39:19,560 --> 01:39:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and she seems really sincere</font></font>

2674
01:39:22,200 --> 01:39:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and uncomplicated.</font></font>

2675
01:39:24,920 --> 01:39:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Gradually, I started liking her.</font></font>

2676
01:39:28,120 --> 01:39:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Little by little.</font></font>

2677
01:39:29,280 --> 01:39:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was when we talked by the sea.</font></font>

2678
01:39:31,040 --> 01:39:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We sat here talking that day,</font></font>

2679
01:39:33,440 --> 01:39:34,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then over on that chair,</font></font>

2680
01:39:34,680 --> 01:39:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we talked some more.</font></font>

2681
01:39:35,760 --> 01:39:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That conversation got really deep.</font></font>

2682
01:39:37,880 --> 01:39:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And after that deep conversation, I realized</font></font>

2683
01:39:39,240 --> 01:39:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're different in so many ways.</font></font>

2684
01:39:40,560 --> 01:39:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You couldn't connect?</font></font>

2685
01:39:41,480 --> 01:39:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not that we couldn't connect.</font></font>

2686
01:39:42,360 --> 01:39:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can understand it,</font></font>

2687
01:39:43,640 --> 01:39:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and accept it,</font></font>

2688
01:39:44,440 --> 01:39:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but</font></font>

2689
01:39:45,800 --> 01:39:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to face our differences.</font></font>

2690
01:39:48,360 --> 01:39:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I think</font></font>

2691
01:39:49,960 --> 01:39:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'd have to make a lot of compromises.</font></font>

2692
01:39:52,000 --> 01:39:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Both of us.</font></font>

2693
01:39:53,600 --> 01:39:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Either I'd have to accommodate her,</font></font>

2694
01:39:54,400 --> 01:39:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or she'd have to accommodate me.</font></font>

2695
01:39:55,600 --> 01:39:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if one of us gets upset,</font></font>

2696
01:39:57,600 --> 01:39:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or something happens,</font></font>

2697
01:39:58,240 --> 01:39:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or she's given up too much for me,</font></font>

2698
01:39:59,840 --> 01:40:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or I've given up too much for her,</font></font>

2699
01:40:01,280 --> 01:40:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when we reach a certain point,</font></font>

2700
01:40:02,240 --> 01:40:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd start thinking,</font></font>

2701
01:40:03,080 --> 01:40:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why should I have to do this?</font></font>

2702
01:40:05,240 --> 01:40:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I don't know</font></font>

2703
01:40:05,800 --> 01:40:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what I should do from here.</font></font>

2704
01:40:08,200 --> 01:40:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know either.</font></font>

2705
01:40:13,240 --> 01:40:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is my own issue too.</font></font>

2706
01:40:16,120 --> 01:40:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Step back. Don't hurt anyone.</font></font>

2707
01:40:18,200 --> 01:40:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Enjoy the time you have left.</font></font>

2708
01:40:25,640 --> 01:40:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang: I'll take her a little Coke]</font></font>

2709
01:40:28,400 --> 01:40:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong: Where did you get it?]</font></font>

2710
01:40:29,440 --> 01:40:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang: I "stole" it]</font></font>

2711
01:40:35,040 --> 01:40:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I come in?</font></font>

2712
01:40:37,000 --> 01:40:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Liu Yuning is asleep]</font></font>

2713
01:40:39,840 --> 01:40:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What? What am I looking at?</font></font>

2714
01:40:42,600 --> 01:40:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I brought you an ice-cold Coke.</font></font>

2715
01:40:43,880 --> 01:40:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Delivering the "stolen Coke"]
Coke.</font></font>

2716
01:40:44,400 --> 01:40:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't tell anyone.</font></font>

2717
01:40:45,120 --> 01:40:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where did you "steal" it from?</font></font>

2718
01:40:47,040 --> 01:40:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very secretly.</font></font>

2719
01:40:47,960 --> 01:40:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really.</font></font>

2720
01:40:50,160 --> 01:40:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was so hard to get.</font></font>

2721
01:40:55,600 --> 01:40:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That ball really hurt when it hit me today.</font></font>

2722
01:40:58,200 --> 01:40:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Romance training class]
Give me one.</font></font>

2723
01:41:02,240 --> 01:41:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sorry.</font></font>

2724
01:41:06,200 --> 01:41:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought I hit it gently.</font></font>

2725
01:41:08,000 --> 01:41:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It hurt. It really hurt.</font></font>

2726
01:41:09,640 --> 01:41:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I got hit right here.</font></font>

2727
01:41:11,040 --> 01:41:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll rub your shoulders in a bit.</font></font>

2728
01:41:13,840 --> 01:41:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A back massage from afar]
A little massage.</font></font>

2729
01:41:17,160 --> 01:41:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's sleeping.</font></font>

2730
01:41:22,640 --> 01:41:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think it's amazing.</font></font>

2731
01:41:23,960 --> 01:41:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's like Doraemon,</font></font>

2732
01:41:25,280 --> 01:41:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or a little hamster.</font></font>

2733
01:41:26,760 --> 01:41:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Out of nowhere,</font></font>

2734
01:41:28,160 --> 01:41:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he pulls out all these random things,</font></font>

2735
01:41:29,840 --> 01:41:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I end up liking all of them.</font></font>

2736
01:41:32,880 --> 01:41:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where did you get it?</font></font>

2737
01:41:34,360 --> 01:41:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I went a long way to secretly "steal" it.</font></font>

2738
01:41:35,920 --> 01:41:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where else would I get a cup of ice?</font></font>

2739
01:41:37,200 --> 01:41:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where did you "steal" it from?</font></font>

2740
01:41:40,120 --> 01:41:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not telling. It's a little secret.</font></font>

2741
01:41:41,240 --> 01:41:42,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You won't tell me?</font></font>

2742
01:41:42,200 --> 01:41:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nobody can see the effort I put in.</font></font>

2743
01:41:44,880 --> 01:41:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want people seeing my efforts, okay?</font></font>

2744
01:41:47,200 --> 01:41:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like doing things quietly.</font></font>

2745
01:41:49,880 --> 01:41:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me have a sip.</font></font>

2746
01:41:50,600 --> 01:41:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't had any yet.</font></font>

2747
01:41:55,680 --> 01:41:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wow, that's woken me right up.</font></font>

2748
01:41:58,640 --> 01:41:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right?</font></font>

2749
01:41:59,600 --> 01:42:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's so hard to get a cold drink.</font></font>

2750
01:42:00,920 --> 01:42:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, exactly.</font></font>

2751
01:42:03,920 --> 01:42:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's see what we've got.</font></font>

2752
01:42:09,920 --> 01:42:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who can relate?</font></font>

2753
01:42:10,800 --> 01:42:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Silkworm pupae]
Are those the pupae we ate before?</font></font>

2754
01:42:13,200 --> 01:42:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seriously?</font></font>

2755
01:42:15,280 --> 01:42:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This should be ready to take off.</font></font>

2756
01:42:17,680 --> 01:42:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's in here?</font></font>

2757
01:42:20,080 --> 01:42:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This?</font></font>

2758
01:42:21,000 --> 01:42:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Sea intestine rice]
Sea intestine rice.</font></font>

2759
01:42:24,200 --> 01:42:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll grill some corn first.</font></font>

2760
01:42:26,120 --> 01:42:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want some corn?</font></font>

2761
01:42:26,720 --> 01:42:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are we eating?</font></font>

2762
01:42:27,920 --> 01:42:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want shrimp.</font></font>

2763
01:42:30,280 --> 01:42:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Put the meat on first.</font></font>

2764
01:42:31,440 --> 01:42:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, the things that take longer.</font></font>

2765
01:42:33,920 --> 01:42:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Chef Yang's secret barbecue.</font></font>

2766
01:42:35,280 --> 01:42:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This really sets the mood.</font></font>

